INSERT INTO `questions` VALUES (19,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT',' tell me about a famous place in your country?',NULL,NULL,5,0,30,'click',NULL,NULL,'set1'),(20,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Please tell me about the last thing you saw on television.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,0,30,'click',NULL,NULL,'set1'),(21,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','What did the man forget to bring?','Man: Hey, did you bring the project report for the meeting?\r\nWoman: Yes, I have it right here. Did you bring the presentation slides?\r\nMan: Oh no, I completely forgot to bring the slides! I thought you had them.\r\nWoman: No, you said you would prepare them.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click',NULL,NULL,'set1'),(22,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Where are they planning to go this weekend?','Woman: Do you want to go somewhere this weekend?\r\nMan: Sure, I was thinking about going to the beach.\r\nWoman: The beach sounds nice, but it might be too crowded.\r\nMan: That\'s true. What about going to the mountains instead?\r\nWoman: That\'s a great idea! Let\'s do that.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'select',NULL,NULL,'set1'),(65,5,'MCQ',' I enjoy working on challenging projects at work.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','1ca097cb-bb30-4854-9d44-3b40824bb7eb','set1'),(66,5,'MCQ','We could cook dinner. ____, we could buy some takeaway food. ',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','486fbadc-7064-4750-b827-1018230cbad9','set1'),(67,5,'MCQ','In those days, my father ____ never eat dinner after eight o\' clock. ',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','9d6f051a-c01b-4a1f-9efb-302cd3b45a68','set1'),(68,5,'MCQ','He ____ finished cooking when we arrived. ',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','ae2c2d77-267b-459c-a733-6482e09a301b','set1'),(69,5,'MCQ','If you were a better cook, you ____ need to eat out all the time.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','23cf2001-6839-4cad-92f3-07a45cb3d7a6','set1'),(70,5,'MCQ','There were ____ than fifty people in the audience last night. ',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','0c4eced1-bff8-4c09-a4a5-b4c60fd008e6','set1'),(71,5,'MCQ','The children ____ playing football for two hours before it started raining.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','07260dab-dbc6-401e-975c-ed5bbc2a7cca','set1'),(72,5,'MCQ','I wish it ____ the time of year when I could go on holiday. ',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','69541590-1f3c-48a8-9460-4395e110d54a','set1'),(73,5,'MCQ','We ____ have caught the early train, as the football match was delayed.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','868ea6de-dbfa-4290-975f-d76415af12cd','set1'),(74,5,'MCQ','That man\'s so unreliable you can\'t trust him. _____\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','259503f9-7545-4721-9edb-9627429abb0a','set1'),(75,5,'MCQ','Go to the end of the street and turn ____ right.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','6e43a5c6-9bac-48f3-9081-56ae401b038a','set1'),(76,5,'MCQ','____ you like to go out this evening?\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','34b65927-aaac-4cc5-a821-cee962a6465c','set1'),(77,5,'MCQ','I think it is right ____ children to play outside with toys.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','9e88fa94-2dcd-4d86-b90c-5d50840d5d2c','set1'),(78,5,'MCQ','How much ____ the train to Santiago cost?\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','74bf67ae-89cc-4b2a-9b80-d7e71bd46219','set1'),(79,5,'MCQ','The film starts ____ half past four.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','4369788b-e749-4a8c-916b-164e930ef3e5','set1'),(80,5,'MCQ','He is single. He never ____. \r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','1bd29063-1f60-456e-b854-84dd0205919e','set1'),(81,5,'MCQ','She reads every day ____ she isn\'t serious. \r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','9fe240eb-b2e0-45fb-9409-6f7544659833','set1'),(82,5,'MCQ','He ____ in Cairo.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','ed26e276-ced8-43e9-b94f-fb97e190b849','set1'),(83,5,'MCQ','William ____ in South America now. \r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','2c9e1179-0664-4156-bb9c-aa6f1955a0c2','set1'),(84,5,'MCQ','Excuse me, I\'m lost. ____ you help me?\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','6fa8938d-c6d1-49aa-830b-18f6389a4640','set1'),(85,5,'MCQ','You ____ to do your homework by tomorrow.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','6405bfb4-9b89-4728-8f63-9b48a6a2dc58','set1'),(86,5,'MCQ','I had a shower, ____ I went to bed.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','c6782eea-ad3f-45e7-b62b-9d47335165c8','set1'),(87,5,'MCQ','I ____ to work when I saw Steve.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','8edd93b8-a995-46ea-a478-ea5f9347a0af','set1'),(88,5,'MCQ','I ____ use to swim much, but now I have my own pool, I swim every day.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','540c6905-ab59-4683-968c-4d26bb557c50','set1'),(89,5,'MCQ','I just heard they are ____ get married in June.\r\n',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null','576ae855-803b-44e5-92e8-d91919e1b77e','set1'),(110,5,'QUESTION_FORM','Select a word from each drop-down list on the right that has the same or a very similar meaning to each word on the left. Example: big = large',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(111,5,'MCQ','study ',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'select','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(112,5,'MCQ','start ',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'select','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(113,5,'MCQ','receive ',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'select','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(114,5,'MCQ','talk ',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'select','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(115,5,'MCQ','pick ',NULL,NULL,1,5,NULL,'select','null','ee511a5b-72da-429c-9d60-930b0294cb6f','set1'),(117,5,'QUESTION_FORM','Complete each sentence using a word from each drop-down list.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(118,5,'MCQ','More and more people go [blank]	\r\nfor their holidays these days.',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'select','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(119,5,'MCQ','Drivers need to remain 	[blank]\r\nwhen in charge of a car.',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'select','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(120,5,'MCQ','The city has many [blank]	\r\nand interesting buildings.',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'select','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(121,5,'MCQ','She\'s a highly [blank]\r\nperson who explains things clearly.',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'select','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(122,5,'MCQ','He\'s a very [blank]\r\nperson always getting into fights.',NULL,NULL,1,5,NULL,'select','null','55d08306-812f-47aa-a02a-d83c6a1baf90','set1'),(140,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the email from Janice to her friend Sally. Choose one word from the drop-down list for each gap. The first one is done for you. ',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(141,4,'MCQ','The weather is [blank]\r\n and it\'s really hot.',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'select','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(142,4,'MCQ','Yesterday morning we went on a [blank]\r\n to catch some fish.',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'select','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(143,4,'MCQ','e had lunch in a bar and [blank]\r\n we visited an old church.',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'select','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(144,4,'MCQ','Tomorrow we are going to take a car and [blank]\r\n around.',NULL,NULL,3,4,NULL,'select','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(145,4,'MCQ','I hope it won\'t be [blank]\r\n hot! ',NULL,NULL,3,5,NULL,'select','null','642afdec-8fc5-43f3-b690-7bfad309f6f1','set1'),(146,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from a report. Put the sentences in the right order. The first sentence is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','a59cc5e5-73f5-47cd-ab24-6d93fef1f522','set1'),(147,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','Signs on the coast road\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,'click','{\"items\": [{\"text\": \"For this reason it is easy for them to take a wrong turn and get lost.\", \"order\": 3}, {\"text\": \"These will help visitors to find their way to our beautiful town.\", \"order\": 5}, {\"text\": \"This road is busy during the summer when tourists visit the area.\", \"order\": 1}, {\"text\": \"They donΓÇÖt know the road because many of them are here for the first time.\", \"order\": 2}, {\"text\": \"This is why we think there should be more signs along the road.\", \"order\": 4}], \"drag_items\": [\"Item 1\"], \"drop_zones\": [\"Zone 1\"], \"fixed_sentence\": \"This report gives information about the traffic problems on the coast road.\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','a59cc5e5-73f5-47cd-ab24-6d93fef1f522','set1'),(148,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from some instructions. Put the sentences in the right order. The first sentence is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d7820c64-eca7-4ac5-836a-38614ad64379','set1'),(149,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','Instructions for office visitors\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,'click','{\"items\": [{\"text\": \"A member of staff will write this information in the visitorΓÇÖs book.\", \"order\": 2}, {\"text\": \"Before you leave, please return the card to a member of staff at the front desk.\", \"order\": 5}, {\"text\": \"You can then use the card to enter through the security gate.\", \"order\": 4}, {\"text\": \"Next, he or she will give you a visitorΓÇÖs identity card.\", \"order\": 3}, {\"text\": \"You should go to the front desk upon arrival and give your name and\", \"order\": 1}], \"drag_items\": [\"Item 1\"], \"drop_zones\": [\"Zone 1\"], \"fixed_sentence\": \"If you are visiting our office for the first time, please follow these instructions.\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','d7820c64-eca7-4ac5-836a-38614ad64379','set1'),(150,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four people respond in the comments section of an online magazine article about education and work. Read their comments and answer the questions below.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(151,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Education and work',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(152,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person A:\r\n\r\nAs you get older, responsibilities like a job and family dominate your life. It can be hard to balance things. Studying at university is demanding. So you should do it at an age when you are independent and carefree. It is also important to learn how the world of business works. Spending unpaid time in a company is a great way to get that experience. Any course that can give you an opportunity to do that is worth considering.',NULL,NULL,0,2,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(153,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person B:\r\n\r\nLife doesn\'t really get serious until you hit your mid-twenties. Before that, try out different things and get some life experience. It\'s only as you approach your thirties that you need to get serious about your career. That\'s the time to start thinking about further education. Many colleges offer inexpensive courses for more mature students. Going back to student life for a year is a great idea and you can then return to the world of work at management level.',NULL,NULL,0,3,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(154,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person C:\r\n\r\nNowadays it is popular for school leavers to take a break before they think about an occupation or a place at university. I think the most important thing is to start working as soon as you can. You need practical experience for your CV and that can be more valuable than a diploma. Nevertheless, your studies do not have to stop just because you are working. Colleges and universities offer options for people who want to do both.',NULL,NULL,0,4,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(155,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person D:\r\n\r\nI think we should all keep learning, but you don\'t need a piece of paper from an institution to prove it. There are many free courses available online. Of course, not all are good, but a little research will help you identify which one is best for you. A lot of young people get into debt because they have to pay for their studies. With the resources available online these days, you can take control. You won\'t regret it.',NULL,NULL,0,5,NULL,'click','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(156,4,'MCQ','1. Who thinks you should study when you are older?',NULL,NULL,2,6,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(157,4,'MCQ','2. Who thinks formal qualifications are too expensive?',NULL,NULL,2,7,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(158,4,'MCQ','3. Who thinks you should go to university when you are young?',NULL,NULL,2,8,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(159,4,'MCQ','4. Who thinks you should study independently? ',NULL,NULL,2,9,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(160,4,'MCQ','5. Who thinks you should combine a job with studying?',NULL,NULL,2,10,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(161,4,'MCQ','6. Who thinks you should choose a course that is practical?',NULL,NULL,2,11,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(162,4,'MCQ','7. Who thinks you should get a job immediately after leaving school? ',NULL,NULL,2,12,NULL,'select','null','fdc9b08b-83da-41e6-b1e4-71b4d3160443','set1'),(163,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Please scroll down to access all 7 response boxes.\r\n\r\nRead the passage quickly. Choose a heading for each numbered paragraph from the drop-down box. There is one more heading than you need.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','33031e3f-dc4f-420d-b4bc-49da25cca731','set1'),(164,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Mission to Mars\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','33031e3f-dc4f-420d-b4bc-49da25cca731','set1'),(165,4,'MCQ','1. On 3rd June 2010 an international crew of six astronauts entered a space ship and prepared themselves for a 520-day voyage to the planet Mars and back. The module that was to be their home for the next year and a half contained their sleeping quarters, a kitchen/dining room, a living room, a control room and a toilet. There was also space for food storage, a small greenhouse, a bathroom, a sauna and even a gym. The Mars landing was scheduled for 12th February 2011, following a 255-day flight, and would involve a full two days of exploration of the planet surface. An equally long return journey would see the astronauts return to earth on 4th November 2011.',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'select','null','33031e3f-dc4f-420d-b4bc-49da25cca731','set1'),(166,4,'MCQ','2. Emerging from the spaceship after an exhausting 520 days, Russian commander Alexei Sitev declared the mission finally over. \'The programme has been fully carried out,\' he announced at a press conference. \'All the crew members are in good health. We are now ready for further tests.\' Indeed, the general consensus in the scientific community was that the Mars 500 project had achieved its aims, and, what is more, the crew had managed to complete their mission without ever having to leave the EarthΓÇÖs atmosphere.',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'select','null','33031e3f-dc4f-420d-b4bc-49da25cca731','set1'),(167,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You want to join the History Club. You have received five messages from a club member. Write short answers (1–5 words) to each message.\r\n\r\nRecommended time: 3 minutes.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\nMessage: How are you?\r\nAnswer: I’m fine, thanks.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(168,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is the weather like today?\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(169,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite time of year?\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(170,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite colour?\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(171,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your job?\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,4,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(172,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What do you usually do in your free time?\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL,'click','null','4c512b8a-d39b-46e4-beac-bda556990a38','set1'),(173,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','You want to join the History Club. Complete the form by writing your answers in full sentences. Use 20–30 words for each answer.\r\n\r\nPlease write some of the reasons why you are interested in history.',NULL,NULL,5,0,NULL,'click','null','ef2f62e6-cf58-4cab-98b4-999a29da87dd','set1'),(176,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a member of the History Club. You received this email from the club.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','8e6ae565-939b-4aa0-be72-877d4b2145f9','set1'),(177,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear Member,\r\n\r\nWe are writing to tell you that the trip to Blackrock Castle has been cancelled because of lack of interest. You will be given a refund for the cost of the coach trip. However, because this is a late cancellation we cannot refund the cost of your entrance ticket to the castle. We apologise for this and thank you for your understanding.\r\n\r\nThe President',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','8e6ae565-939b-4aa0-be72-877d4b2145f9','set1'),(178,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Write an email to your friend. Write about your feelings and what you think the club should do about the situation. Write about 50 words. Recommended time: 10 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','8e6ae565-939b-4aa0-be72-877d4b2145f9','set1'),(179,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Write an email to the president of the club. Write about your feelings and what you think the club should do about the situation. Write 120ΓÇô150 words. Recommended time: 20 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','8e6ae565-939b-4aa0-be72-877d4b2145f9','set1'),(180,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Four people are describing their plans for the future. Complete the sentences below.\r\nSpeaker A wants to\r\n','Speaker A:\r\nIΓÇÖve always loved studying, and I want to continue my education after finishing school. My dream is to go to college and learn more about science.\r\n\r\nSpeaker B:\r\nI really enjoy exploring new cultures and meeting different people. In the future, I would like to work in a different country and gain international experience.\r\n\r\nSpeaker C:\r\nI have many ideas and I like being independent. One day, I want to start a business and build something of my own from the ground up.\r\n\r\nSpeaker D:\r\nFor me, life is about experiences. I want to travel the world, see new places, and maybe even write a book about my journeys later.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','4053fd1c-ec47-4e75-bfb3-a03305b35696','set1'),(181,2,'MCQ','Speaker B wants to ',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'select','null','4053fd1c-ec47-4e75-bfb3-a03305b35696','set1'),(182,2,'MCQ','Speaker C wants to',NULL,NULL,4,2,NULL,'select','null','4053fd1c-ec47-4e75-bfb3-a03305b35696','set1'),(183,2,'MCQ','Speaker D wants to',NULL,NULL,4,3,NULL,'select','null','4053fd1c-ec47-4e75-bfb3-a03305b35696','set1'),(184,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two parents discussing the issue of children\'s health. Read the opinions below and decide whose opinion matches the statements, the man, the woman, or both the man and the woman. 1. Parents should better manage their children\'s diets. ','Woman:\r\nI will have been reading about children\'s health, and I think parents should better manage their children\'s diets. Kids eat too much junk food these days.\r\n\r\nMan:\r\nI agree. Diet is important, but I also think parents should support their children\'s interest in sport. Physical activity really helps their overall development.\r\n\r\nWoman:\r\nThatΓÇÖs true. Along with that, children also need some quiet time. It can really help improve their concentration and focus, especially for schoolwork.\r\n\r\nMan:\r\nAbsolutely. But at the same time, too much rest isn\'t good either. Excessive sleep can actually be bad for young people if it becomes a habit.\r\n\r\nWoman:\r\nYes, balance is the key\'s healthy food, regular exercise, enough quiet time, and proper sleep.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c5d38e71-ee7c-434c-8f4f-8c329fca08ef','set1'),(185,2,'MCQ','2. Parents should support their childrens interest in sport. ',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'select','null','c5d38e71-ee7c-434c-8f4f-8c329fca08ef','set1'),(186,2,'MCQ','3. Quiet time can promote children\'s concentration abilities.',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','c5d38e71-ee7c-434c-8f4f-8c329fca08ef','set1'),(187,2,'MCQ','4. Excessive sleep can be bad for young people. ',NULL,NULL,3,3,30,'select','null','c5d38e71-ee7c-434c-8f4f-8c329fca08ef','set1'),(188,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a city planner talk at a press conference about a new transport plan and answer the questions below.\r\n\r\n1. What is the main goal of the new transport plan?','Good morning, everyone. Thank you for attending this press conference. Today, I\'m here to introduce our new transport plan for the city. The main goal of this plan is to reduce traffic congestion and improve air quality.\r\n\r\nWe are planning to expand public transport by adding more buses and introducing two new metro lines. These changes will make it easier for people to travel across the city quickly and efficiently.\r\n\r\nIn addition, we will create more cycling lanes and improve pedestrian pathways to encourage eco-friendly travel. This will not only reduce pollution but also promote a healthier lifestyle among residents.\r\n\r\nThe project will begin next year and is expected to be completed within five years. We understand that there may be some disruptions during construction, but we will try to minimize inconvenience to the public.\r\n\r\nFinally, we are also introducing a smart ticketing system, which will allow passengers to use a single card for all types of transport.\r\n\r\nThank you for your attention. I\'m happy to take any questions now.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','a72630a0-f87a-4bdf-b698-2d6ecfedf22c','set1'),(189,2,'MCQ','What is his opinion of the role of the media?',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'cl