ted a solid ice highway existed. However, contemporary critics claimed that driving a small, low-powered ship into moving southern ice floes was complete madness. They stated that shifting tabular icebergs would easily trap and crush the wooden vessel. Shackleton maintained that a small hull with careful steering could slip through narrow leads instead of getting pinned down. It was this navigational approach he set out to validate.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1144,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:\r\nThe Nimrod was heavily altered by adding structural reinforcements to the wooden bow. It was prepared using local maritime yards, incorporating dense oak beams and thick metal plating. The hull was packed with insulating felt to withstand sub-zero conditions. The completed vessel was relatively small, forcing the crew to share cramped living spaces below deck. They had to pack immense stores to survive years in the ice, loading tons of coal, specialized pemmican rations, tinned vegetables, and dried forage for their transport animals. Their basic survival food was supplemented by hunting penguins and seals found along the frozen coastline.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,2,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1145,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:\r\nThe carefully assembled shore party—comprising geologists, biologists, seasoned sailors, and medical officers—was handpicked by Shackleton. The primary scientific tools they packed included heavy magnetic compasses, mercurial barometers, sledging meters, and basic camera gear, which were used to chart coastal positions and record meteorological changes during the long polar night.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,3,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1146,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:\r\nThe expedition departed from the port of Lyttelton on New Year\'s Day, 1908. The vessel braved treacherous stormy waters before hitting dense pack ice near the Antarctic continent. By February, they established a base camp at Cape Royds, unloading equipment before the ship retreated north to avoid being frozen in. Their winter brought total isolation in the dark frozen wastes. Finally, after months of preparation, Shackleton and three companions made a brilliant southern march, setting a record for the closest approach to the Pole in history before turning back safely to avoid starvation, meeting the returning ship just as supplies ran out.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,4,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1147,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:\r\nShackleton\'s return generated a massive wave of mixed opinions across the geographic community. Critics pointed out that the actual South Pole was never reached, claiming the mission was an incomplete success. They argued that his choices regarding transport animals were flawed, slowing down the pace of the journey. However, subsequent surveys confirmed the accuracy of their mountain mapping, completely redefining the world\'s understanding of the Antarctic interior layout.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,5,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1148,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:\r\nSince the Nimrod\'s historic southern push, several famous polar teams have followed similar routes. While some met with tragic outcomes, later expeditions utilized mechanized tractors and modern aircraft to reach the Pole safely. Decades later, research teams retraced Shackleton\'s precise tracks to study glacier movement, filming award-winning historical documentaries that captured the harsh environment.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,6,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1149,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:\r\nErnest Shackleton\'s legendary survival story has deeply captured the public imagination for generations. His popular travel book, The Heart of the Antarctic, was published in 1909 and instantly became a massive bestseller. The raw photograph plates and journals won international geographical medals. Today, the original wooden hut at Cape Royds is preserved as a historic landmark, remaining one of the most protected sites in the Antarctic treaty zone.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,7,NULL,'click','null','52b5608e-90e1-4e53-9a64-00fa4e471678','set3'),(1150,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the email given below. The first one is done for you\r\nChoose one word (A, B, or C) for each space and write the letter on the answer sheet.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1151,4,'MCQ','We need [blank] clear printouts for the staff.',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1152,4,'MCQ','Don’t [blank] to forward the digital files to the manager.',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1153,4,'MCQ','The shipping department [blank] early on Fridays.',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1154,4,'MCQ','I have a presentation scheduled in the conference [blank] .',NULL,NULL,3,4,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1155,4,'MCQ','I will see you at the main lobby at [blank] 5 o’clock',NULL,NULL,3,5,NULL,'click','null','bc210355-c2e2-46b4-a801-4011303e2550','set4'),(1156,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from a report. Put the sentences in the right order. The first sentence is done for you.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','eb956e32-117a-442c-99da-0d1fc01f35f7','set4'),(1157,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','Put the sentences (B – F) in the right order. Write your answers on the answer sheet. (Questions 6 – 10).\r\n',NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,'click','{\"items\": [{\"text\": \"Please key your assigned passcode immediately into the numeric keypad to test if it opens correctly.\", \"order\": 5}, {\"text\": \"Our digital system will generate one of these access tokens as soon as user clearance updates.\", \"order\": 4}, {\"text\": \"In exchange for your registration form, a desk clerk will provide your unique key code sequence.\", \"order\": 3}, {\"text\": \"You can complete this process at the IT support office any time during weekly operations.\", \"order\": 2}, {\"text\": \"Before you can utilize the network terminals, you\'ll need an active student clearance card.\", \"order\": 1}], \"drag_items\": [\"Item 1\"], \"drop_zones\": [\"Zone 1\"], \"fixed_sentence\": \"\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','eb956e32-117a-442c-99da-0d1fc01f35f7','set4'),(1158,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory guide about traditional pottery design. ',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','e48e0de7-8a7f-4753-b1b9-cf9236cb90a1','set4'),(1159,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','Put the sentences (B – F) in the right order.\r\nWrite your answers on the answer sheet (Questions 11 – 15).\r\n',NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,'click','{\"items\": [{\"text\": \"Apprentice potters must comprehend how all these firing steps and temperature controls interact.\", \"order\": 2}, {\"text\": \"This ancient skill allows craftsmen to apply mineral glazes to produce vivid earth tones.\", \"order\": 3}, {\"text\": \"Their choice of kiln environment is critical because different heat variations create distinct surface finishes.\", \"order\": 1}, {\"text\": \"Students can learn these throwing methods inside specialized workshops in central Florence.\", \"order\": 4}, {\"text\": \"The artisan begins by selecting high-grade raw clay compounds for the starting vessel mass.\", \"order\": 5}], \"drag_items\": [\"Item 1\"], \"drop_zones\": [\"Zone 1\"], \"fixed_sentence\": \"\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','e48e0de7-8a7f-4753-b1b9-cf9236cb90a1','set4'),(1160,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a new member of the cooking club. Fill in the form. Write sentences. Use 20 – 30 words. You have seven minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','df284363-a439-4edb-adca-f0993968a930','set4'),(1161,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Please write some reasons why you are interested in learning how to cook.',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','df284363-a439-4edb-adca-f0993968a930','set4'),(1162,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a member of a cooking club. You are talking to some members in the cooking club chat room. Talk to them using sentences. Use 30 – 40 words per answer. You have ten minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','647f40cc-7711-45ad-9b6a-d73b4c45e5e6','set4'),(1163,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Chef Marcus: Hi! Welcome to the club. Can you remember the very first dish you tried to make by yourself? How did it taste?',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','647f40cc-7711-45ad-9b6a-d73b4c45e5e6','set4'),(1164,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Elena: Welcome! What are the most traditional or popular dishes to try in your country?',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','647f40cc-7711-45ad-9b6a-d73b4c45e5e6','set4'),(1165,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Oliver: What is the most complicated or difficult recipe you have ever tried to prepare?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','647f40cc-7711-45ad-9b6a-d73b4c45e5e6','set4'),(1166,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a member of a cooking club. You received this email from the club.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','11bac1e0-39ca-4b43-9eb1-eb155f4a5b17','set4'),(1167,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear member,\n\nWe are writing to inform you that the famous pastry chef, Mr. Jacques Dupont, will unfortunately not be able to attend our next baking masterclass. Although Mr. Dupont will not be there to demonstrate his classic techniques, members of the club will be able to buy a signed copy of his new recipe book, \'Sweet Perfections\', at the special price of 20 dollars. If you would like to reserve a copy of the book, please contact the club secretary.\n',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','11bac1e0-39ca-4b43-9eb1-eb155f4a5b17','set4'),(1168,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 1: Write an email to your friend. Write about your feelings and what you are planning to do. Write about 50 words. You have ten minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','11bac1e0-39ca-4b43-9eb1-eb155f4a5b17','set4'),(1169,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 2: Write an email to the secretary of the club. Write about your feelings and what you would like to do. Write 120 – 150 words. You have 20 minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','11bac1e0-39ca-4b43-9eb1-eb155f4a5b17','set4'),(1170,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are in a fitness club. You have 5 messages from a member of the club. Write short answers (1 – 5 words) to each message.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1171,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite sport?',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1172,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What exercise did you do yesterday?',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1173,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What\'s your favourite workout time?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1174,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','How do you feel today?',NULL,NULL,5,4,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1175,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','How do you get to the gym?',NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL,'click','null','e53af925-40c4-404c-a485-0b4436bb2fb1','set5'),(1178,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood newsletter regarding their opinions on the city\'s newly opened botanical garden greenhouse. Read the texts and answer Questions 16 – 22. Choose one answer (A, B, C or D) and mark it on your answer sheet.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1179,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person A\r\nThe glaring issue with this greenhouse facility is the critical shortage of educational signs. The few they have are constantly obscured and visitors wander around for hours looking for species names. This situation gets worse during school field trips. I prefer studying here because the public arboretum across town is loud. Many display tables are half-vacant, so they should remove them and put up informational interactive boards instead.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1180,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person B\r\nMost of the seating benches in the tropical palm house are ancient and rotting away. Management should replace the furniture with weather-resistant structures and fix the loose wooden walkway railings too. The cactus section is curated well but plant tags get misplaced constantly. You need a dedicated guide there to keep the layout tidy. Having three staff members standing idly at the exit door is an absolute waste of workforce budget.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,2,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1181,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person C\r\nI find it very hard to navigate the themed pathways inside this layout. The numbering along the pathways isn\'t logical. Maps are poorly placed and markers often get hidden by fast-growing vines. Furthermore, the orchid house is built too close to the main ventilation fans, which are supposed to run quietly. It is incredibly deafening when the climate units cycle on. The walkways are way too cramped with no space to stop and sketch plants.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,3,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1182,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person D\r\nI\'ve always loved visiting this glasshouse. Since my student days it was an incredible sanctuary to collect research data and study. I still visit weekly to inspect rare ferns and access the online directory system. The plant diversity is amazing, but there is a severe shortage of maintenance staff on site. I notice this particularly when automated misting nozzles clog or break. There is never a technician available to fix mechanical problems, which happen frequently.\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,4,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1183,4,'MCQ','Who thinks the greenhouse facility requires a larger maintenance crew?',NULL,NULL,2,5,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1184,4,'MCQ','Who wants empty display benches removed to install digital learning interfaces?',NULL,NULL,2,6,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1185,4,'MCQ','Who thinks the walkway maps and path indicators need better organization?',NULL,NULL,2,7,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1186,4,'MCQ','Who thinks the seating fixtures and safety railings should be upgraded?',NULL,NULL,2,8,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1187,4,'MCQ','Who mentions that peaceful viewing spaces get disrupted by loud automated machinery?',NULL,NULL,2,9,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1188,4,'MCQ','Who runs into regular technical failures with automated plant care devices?',NULL,NULL,2,10,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1189,4,'MCQ','Who utilizes the conservatory space specifically to carry out academic study?',NULL,NULL,1,11,NULL,'click','null','fd81b25b-5856-4f31-b360-e2824844ee02','set4'),(1190,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a new member of the fitness club. Fill in the form. Write sentences. Use 20 – 30 words. You have seven minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','74c7ee4d-40b1-4bcb-a3d8-ebe09a5d217a','set5'),(1191,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Please write some reasons why you are interested in joining a fitness club.',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','74c7ee4d-40b1-4bcb-a3d8-ebe09a5d217a','set5'),(1192,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the email given below. Choose one word from the drop-down list for each gap.',NULL,'uploads/questions/7192c5f0-9948-4df5-a3db-ba81657e390b.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','71f17f4c-0855-470f-a48b-3b2b1b289e9d','set5'),(1193,4,'MCQ','We need [blank] clear printouts for the staff.',NULL,'uploads/questions/6f3ca30b-2ee0-4265-b9c3-fe5bfb9a25b9.',3,0,NULL,'select','null','71f17f4c-0855-470f-a48b-3b2b1b289e9d','set5'),(1194,4,'MCQ','Don’t [blank] to forward 