ng laboratory, please note these rules.\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','6943cf21-b441-4a8f-9a60-b4d9a9e3af9f','set5'),(1200,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory guide about traditional pottery design. Put the sentences in the right order. The first sentence is done for you.',NULL,'uploads/questions/c22dbb39-29f4-4131-acc0-48d68b154091.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','8064b994-5c90-4535-b1c3-78cffa3bf745','set5'),(1201,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','Traditional pottery design\r\n\r\n',NULL,'uploads/questions/a8afe989-209b-4f2e-82af-a48f06b3491a.',4,0,NULL,'click','{\"items\": [{\"text\": \"Apprentice potters must comprehend how all these firing steps and temperature controls interact.\", \"order\": 5}, {\"text\": \"This ancient skill allows craftsmen to apply mineral glazes to produce vivid earth tones.\", \"order\": 3}, {\"text\": \"Their choice of kiln environment is critical because different heat variations create distinct surface finishes.\", \"order\": 4}, {\"text\": \"Students can learn these throwing methods inside specialized workshops in central Florence.\", \"order\": 1}, {\"text\": \"The artisan begins by selecting high-grade raw clay compounds for the starting vessel mass.\", \"order\": 2}], \"drag_items\": [\"Item 1\"], \"drop_zones\": [\"Zone 1\"], \"fixed_sentence\": \"In classical pottery craft there is a meticulous technique of shaping clay manually on a wheel.\", \"correct_mapping\": {\"0\": 0}}','8064b994-5c90-4535-b1c3-78cffa3bf745','set5'),(1202,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood newsletter regarding their opinions on the city\'s newly opened botanical garden greenhouse. Read the texts and answer the questions below.',NULL,'uploads/questions/cec3f615-1232-4328-9126-7dd221d45e32.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1203,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Botanical garden greenhouse',NULL,'uploads/questions/113e68ac-0243-40be-a129-fa3af35f5462.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1204,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person A\r\n\r\nThe glaring issue with this greenhouse facility is the critical shortage of educational signs. The few they have are constantly obscured and visitors wander around for hours looking for species names. This situation gets worse during school field trips. I prefer studying here because the public arboretum across town is loud. Many display tables are half-vacant, so they should remove them and put up informational interactive boards instead.',NULL,'uploads/questions/8f7d4cbd-8989-45d9-8dfc-644d18ee82fc.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1205,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person B\r\n\r\nMost of the seating benches in the tropical palm house are ancient and rotting away. Management should replace the furniture with weather-resistant structures and fix the loose wooden walkway railings too. The cactus section is curated well but plant tags get misplaced constantly. You need a dedicated guide there to keep the layout tidy. Having three staff members standing idly at the exit door is an absolute waste of workforce budget.',NULL,'uploads/questions/45e9c693-4cba-45f9-9c55-8f85c0b056fb.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1206,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person C\r\n\r\nI find it very hard to navigate the themed pathways inside this layout. The numbering along the pathways isn\'t logical. Maps are poorly placed and markers often get hidden by fast-growing vines. Furthermore, the orchid house is built too close to the main ventilation fans, which are supposed to run quietly. It is incredibly deafening when the climate units cycle on. The walkways are way too cramped with no space to stop and sketch plants.',NULL,'uploads/questions/8cf96e9a-3f39-413f-82c6-c7088c30617e.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1207,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person D\r\n\r\nI\'ve always loved visiting this glasshouse. Since my student days it was an incredible sanctuary to collect research data and study. I still visit weekly to inspect rare ferns and access the online directory system. The plant diversity is amazing, but there is a severe shortage of maintenance staff on site. I notice this particularly when automated misting nozzles clog or break. There is never a technician available to fix mechanical problems, which happen frequently.',NULL,'uploads/questions/eb287ba3-9709-424f-92f9-32c6c79c31e5.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1208,4,'MCQ','16. Who thinks the greenhouse facility requires a larger maintenance crew?',NULL,'uploads/questions/a5b39e82-bd90-472b-9c29-e23628f2279c.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1209,4,'MCQ','17. Who wants empty display benches removed to install digital learning interfaces?',NULL,'uploads/questions/76c5f9a5-5d95-4edd-9d79-5adfc4d22564.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1210,4,'MCQ','18. Who thinks the walkway maps and path indicators need better organization?',NULL,'uploads/questions/d417df30-42bb-45a4-af5a-cd1ddd65b879.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1211,4,'MCQ','19. Who thinks the seating fixtures and safety railings should be upgraded?',NULL,'uploads/questions/9d45c477-4017-43a1-bbaa-1f5789b26e5f.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1212,4,'MCQ','20. Who mentions that peaceful viewing spaces get disrupted by loud automated machinery?',NULL,'uploads/questions/4ce1e67b-0d48-4ac6-9863-bfc5a287b0f2.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1213,4,'MCQ','21. Who runs into regular technical failures with automated plant care devices?',NULL,'uploads/questions/87872465-81e2-46b7-9802-5dc67b848983.',1,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1214,4,'MCQ','22. Who utilizes the conservatory space specifically to carry out academic study?',NULL,'uploads/questions/6128730f-029f-4e28-8abe-725c28c34d87.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','12a2f1fe-e3fe-4637-864a-d691cdf51c0d','set5'),(1215,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading for each numbered paragraph (1-7) from the drop-down box. There is one more heading than you need.',NULL,'uploads/questions/2b04d984-67fb-47bd-9b87-952f3f8682fe.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1216,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The Endurance Expedition',NULL,'uploads/questions/81174074-8763-40f3-b9d9-e72a9a3fa2ca.',0,0,NULL,'click','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1217,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a member of a fitness club. You are talking to some members in the fitness club chat room. Talk to them using sentences. Use 30 – 40 words per answer. You have ten minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','7ddae2cd-1368-4020-8b42-7b3a2f1fafbf','set5'),(1218,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Coach Ryan: Hi! Welcome to the club. Can you remember the first time you ran a long distance or completed a tough workout? How did you feel afterward?',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','7ddae2cd-1368-4020-8b42-7b3a2f1fafbf','set5'),(1219,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Sophia: Welcome! What are the best outdoor locations or parks for exercising in your local area?',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','7ddae2cd-1368-4020-8b42-7b3a2f1fafbf','set5'),(1220,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Lucas: What is the most challenging fitness goal or sporting event you have ever achieved?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','7ddae2cd-1368-4020-8b42-7b3a2f1fafbf','set5'),(1221,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:\r\n\r\nShackleton believed a direct passage to the polar plateau could be safely navigated from the Ross Ice Shelf. He argued that geographical contours observed during prior journeys indicated a solid ice highway existed. However, contemporary critics claimed that driving a small, low-powered ship into moving southern ice floes was complete madness. They stated that shifting tabular icebergs would easily trap and crush the wooden vessel. Shackleton maintained that a small hull with careful steering could slip through narrow leads instead of getting pinned down. It was this navigational approach he set out to validate.',NULL,'uploads/questions/4ea8bcba-6a28-416e-aa18-39e8f0a09ad1.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1222,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:\r\n\r\nThe Nimrod was heavily altered by adding structural reinforcements to the wooden bow. It was prepared using local maritime yards, incorporating dense oak beams and thick metal plating. The hull was packed with insulating felt to withstand sub-zero conditions. The completed vessel was relatively small, forcing the crew to share cramped living spaces below deck. They had to pack immense stores to survive years in the ice, loading tons of coal, specialized pemmican rations, tinned vegetables, and dried forage for their transport animals. Their basic survival food was supplemented by hunting penguins and seals found along the frozen coastline.',NULL,'uploads/questions/8f86be7c-78bf-4120-851b-1e8ee390abb1.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1223,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:\r\n\r\nThe carefully assembled shore party—comprising geologists, biologists, seasoned sailors, and medical officers—was handpicked by Shackleton. The primary scientific tools they packed included heavy magnetic compasses, mercurial barometers, sledging meters, and basic camera gear, which were used to chart coastal positions and record meteorological changes during the long polar night.',NULL,'uploads/questions/f742e817-6dd6-42ae-8f8b-69881a434a8f.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1224,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:\r\n\r\nThe expedition departed from the port of Lyttelton on New Year\'s Day, 1908. The vessel braved treacherous stormy waters before hitting dense pack ice near the Antarctic continent. By February, they established a base camp at Cape Royds, unloading equipment before the ship retreated north to avoid being frozen in. Their winter brought total isolation in the dark frozen wastes. Finally, after months of preparation, Shackleton and three companions made a brilliant southern march, setting a record for the closest approach to the Pole in history before turning back safely to avoid starvation, meeting the returning ship just as supplies ran out.',NULL,'uploads/questions/e69a22c8-dd52-4fca-a947-25badbbfb27b.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1225,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:\r\n\r\nShackleton\'s return generated a massive wave of mixed opinions across the geographic community. Critics pointed out that the actual South Pole was never reached, claiming the mission was an incomplete success. They argued that his choices regarding transport animals were flawed, slowing down the pace of the journey. However, subsequent surveys confirmed the accuracy of their mountain mapping, completely redefining the world\'s understanding of the Antarctic interior layout.',NULL,'uploads/questions/1e2b1c2d-9e13-49fe-b315-5f432b01ff21.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1226,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:\r\n\r\nSince the Nimrod\'s historic southern push, several famous polar teams have followed similar routes. While some met with tragic outcomes, later expeditions utilized mechanized tractors and modern aircraft to reach the Pole safely. Decades later, research teams retraced Shackleton\'s precise tracks to study glacier movement, filming award-winning historical documentaries that captured the harsh environment.',NULL,'uploads/questions/0b01773d-4668-45b6-9be1-1fa65f879d11.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1227,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:\r\n\r\nErnest Shackleton\'s legendary survival story has deeply captured the public imagination for generations. His popular travel book, The Heart of the Antarctic, was published in 1909 and instantly became a massive bestseller. The raw photograph plates and journals won international geographical medals. Today, the original wooden hut at Cape Royds is preserved as a historic landmark, remaining one of the most protected sites in the Antarctic treaty zone.',NULL,'uploads/questions/386952bd-a6d6-4743-84ec-f7140b8424d0.',2,0,NULL,'select','null','3351db06-62c9-4cc8-b624-6d5036cd32b1','set5'),(1228,3,'QUESTION_FORM','You are a member of a fitness club. You received this email from the club.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','7ddee2a7-d254-43f8-b960-6fdc4d3ccf03','set5'),(1229,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear member,\n\nWe are writing to inform you that the Olympic gold medalist runner, Ms. Jessica Owens, will unfortunately not be able to attend our upcoming guest speaker evening. Although Ms. Owens will not be there to share her training routines, members of the club will be able to buy an official, autographed club training t-shirt at the special price of 18 dollars. If you would like to reserve a shirt, please contact the club secretary.\n',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','7ddee2a7-d254-43f8-b960-6fdc4d3ccf03','set5'),(1230,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 1: Write an email to your friend. Write about your feelings and what you are planning to do. Write about 50 words. You have ten minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','7ddee2a7-d254-43f8-b960-6fdc4d3ccf03','set5'),(1231,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 2: Write an email to the secretary of the club. Write about your feelings and what you would like to do. Write 120 – 150 words. You have 20 minutes to do this.',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','7ddee2a7-d254-43f8-b960-6fdc4d3ccf03','set5'),(1232,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. There is one more heading than you need.\r\nMatch the headings A – H to the paragraphs 1 – 7 (Questions 23 – 29). Write your answers (A – H) on the answer sheet.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1233,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:\r\nShackleton believed a direct passage to the polar plateau could be safely navigated from the Ross Ice Shelf. He argued that geographical contours observed during prior journeys indicated a solid ice highway existed. However, contemporary critics claimed that driving a small, low-powered ship into moving southern ice floes was complete madness. They stated that shifting tabular icebergs would easily trap and crush the wooden vessel. Shackleton maintained that a small hull with careful steering could slip through narrow leads instead of getting pinned down. It was this navigational approach he set out to validate.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1234,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:\r\nThe Nimrod was heavily altered by adding structural reinforcements to the wooden bow. It was prepared using local maritime yards, incorporating dense oak beams and thick metal plating. The hull was packed with insulating felt to withstand sub-zero conditions. The completed vessel was relatively small, forcing the crew to share cramped living spaces below deck. They had to pack immense stores to survive years in the ice, loading tons of coal, specialized pemmican rations, tinned vegetables, and dried forage for their transport animals. Their basic survival food was supplemented by hunting penguins and seals found along the frozen coastline.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,2,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1235,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:\r\nThe carefully assembled shore party—comprising geologists, biologists, seasoned sailors, and medical officers—was handpicked by Shackleton. The primary scientific tools they packed included heavy magnetic compasses, mercurial barometers, sledging meters, and basic camera gear, which were used to chart coastal positions and record meteorological changes during the long polar night.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,3,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1236,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:\r\nThe expedition departed from the port of Lyttelton on New Year\'s Day, 1908. The vessel braved treacherous stormy waters before hitting dense pack ice near the Antarctic continent. By February, they established a base camp at Cape Royds, unloading equipment before the ship retreated north to avoid being frozen in. Their winter brought total isolation in the dark frozen wastes. Finally, after months of preparation, Shackleton and three companions made a brilliant southern march, setting a record for the closest approach to the Pole in history before turning back safely to avoid starvation, meeting the returning ship just as supplies ran out.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,4,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1237,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:\r\nShackleton\'s return generated a massive wave of mixed opinions across the geographic community. Critics pointed out that the actual South Pole was never reached, claiming the mission was an incomplete success. They argued that his choices regarding transport animals were flawed, slowing down the pace of the journey. However, subsequent surveys confirmed the accuracy of their mountain mapping, completely redefining the world\'s understanding of the Antarctic interior layout.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,5,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1238,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:\r\nSince the Nimrod\'s historic southern push, several famous polar teams have followed similar routes. While some met with tragic outcomes, later expeditions utilized mechanized tractors and modern aircraft to reach the Pole safely. Decades later, research teams retraced Shackleton\'s precise tracks to study glacier movement, filming award-winning historical documentaries that captured the harsh environment.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,6,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1239,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:\r\nErnest Shackleton\'s legendary survival story has deeply captured the public imagination for generations. His popular travel book, The Heart of the Antarctic, was published in 1909 and instantly became a massive bestseller. The raw photograph plates and journals won international geographical medals. Today, the original wooden hut at Cape Royds is preserved as a historic landmark, remaining one of the most protected sites in the Antarctic treaty zone.\r\n',NULL,NULL,2,7,NULL,'click','null','165a206a-2cb6-4a9e-bdaf-37fc251f9f2b','set4'),(1242,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Tell me about your favourite outdoor hobby or recreational activity.',NULL,NULL,5,0,30,'click','null','262c2bd5-09df-4985-a579-8f587a3020f1','set6'),(1243,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','How do you usually stay relaxed when facing tight deadlines at work or school?',NULL,NULL,5,0,30,'click','null','262c2bd5-09df-4985-a579-8f587a3020f1','set6'),(1244,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Describe a memorable celebration or holiday you spent with family members.',NULL,NULL,6,0,30,'click','null','262c2bd5-09df-4985-a579-8f587a3020f1','set6'),(1245,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Describe this picture.',NULL,'uploads/questions/speaking_set6_img1.png',8,0,45,'click','null','89ffbfc1-681d-4257-a06c-47180c57be6f','set6'),(1246,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Tell me about a time you shopped at a local market or artisanal food fair.',NULL,NULL,8,0,45,'click','null','89ffbfc1-681d-4257-a06c-47180c57be6f','set6'),(1247,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','Do you think neighborhood markets offer better community benefits than large supermarkets?',NULL,NULL,8,0,45,'click','null','89ffbfc1-681d-4257-a06c-47180c57be6f','set6'),(1248,1,'SPEAKING_PROMPT','How important is adopting renewable energy sources for future urban development?',NULL,'uploads/questions/speaking_set6_img3.png',10,0,45,'click','null','a8c1a648-318a-4b28-9086-57232e01686d','set6'),(1249,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Rachel calls to schedule a project meeting. When does Rachel want her colleague to arrive?
Rachel wants her colleague to arrive ____________.','Rachel: Hi Thomas, this is Rachel from logistics. Regarding our project kickoff, I know we originally mentioned nine o\'clock, but the boardroom is only booked until nine-fifteen. Could you please get here before 9.00 am, say around quarter to nine? That way we can set up our slides without rushing.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','b9c180c9-e523-440a-8520-7af5d5385c5a','set6'),(1250,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Colin calls his friend to suggest ways of reaching the mountain resort. How do most tourists travel there?
Most tourists travel to the resort by taking a ____________.','Colin: Hello Simon! If you\'re coming up to the alpine resort this weekend, you could rent a car, but driving up those narrow icy cliffs is pretty stressful. Almost all travelers take the express shuttle bus from the central station. It drops you right at the hotel entrance.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','210a80c0-2f57-4bb0-8228-bef7e3fe919b','set6'),(1251,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Sarah leaves a voicemail about her nephew Liam. What does he drink every morning?
In the morning, Liam always drinks ____________.','Sarah: Hi Aunt Linda, just calling to give you an update about Liam. You asked about his breakfast habit. While he likes eggs occasionally, he refuses tea or juice and insists on drinking warm milk every single morning before heading off to nursery.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','d5dc65a4-4333-4aa7-bd75-142a0e9eb38b','set6'),(1252,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Karen calls to announce a change to the department dinner. What day will the dinner take place?
The department dinner next week will take place on ____________.','Karen: Hey team, Karen here. Just a quick reminder about our department celebration dinner. We initially planned it for Wednesday, but the banquet hall was fully booked. So we\'ve shifted the reservation to Thursday evening at seven. See you all then!',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','0f31f0e4-0b91-4a5f-9934-8ec2f9c75fc4','set6'),(1253,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Jason leaves his friend an audio message after the gym session. What did he misplace?
Jason misplaced his ____________.','Jason: Hey Maggie, I think I left something behind after our workout session today. I had my gym bag and car keys in hand, but when I got to my vehicle, I realized my smart watch was missing from my wrist. Did you happen to spot it near the lockers?',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','a1b8f890-499e-4937-b528-51c52ab73306','set6'),(1254,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two colleagues discussing their lunch plans. What do they decide to do?
The colleagues decide to ____________.','Colleague 1: Are you heading out to the food court for lunch? Colleague 2: Oh, it\'s pouring rain outside and the queues will be terrible. Why don\'t we just grab sandwiches at the cafe downstairs on the ground floor? Colleague 1: Good idea, that saves us braving the storm.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','56c455d6-4c06-4373-9b54-0375f2cfb891','set6'),(1255,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a customer in an electronics store. What type of vacuum cleaner does she want to purchase?
The woman wants to purchase ____________.','Customer: Hello, I\'m looking for a new vacuum cleaner for my three-bedroom apartment. I don\'t want a heavy upright machine that strains my back, and robot vacuums miss the corners. I\'d like a lightweight cordless vacuum with strong suction and a long battery life, please.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','847c0fb7-f4ae-466f-9f21-76016303f6e2','set6'),(1256,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a tenant talking about his new apartment. What does he plan to replace?
He is planning to replace the ____________.','Tenant: Overall, the new flat has great natural light and modern floorboards, but the previous owner put up these dark, heavy balcony blinds that block the skyline view completely. I\'m definitely taking them down this Saturday and replacing them with sheer curtains.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','2345a537-57a6-4831-aac9-4b6bbcda0ead','set6'),(1257,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to the community radio broadcast. Whose award ceremony is taking place in August?
The person receiving an award in August is ____________.','Radio Announcer: Turning to regional community news, City Hall will host its annual civic honors banquet in August. The distinguished community leadership award this August will be presented to Professor Evans for his outstanding contribution to environmental education.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','4dc4707d-aa9d-406e-a7ca-f83394818c82','set6'),(1258,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Fiona leaves a message for her driver. What time does she need the airport taxi?
The airport taxi should arrive at ____________.','Fiona: Hello, Prime Taxis? I have a booking for an airport drop-off this afternoon. My flight boarding time moved forward slightly, so instead of picking me up at four-fifteen, could the driver arrive at 3.15 pm sharp at my residence? Thank you.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','6190ea17-8a06-48bc-bc1d-170bb2447a22','set6'),(1259,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Two nurses are discussing their work roster. Why is the hospital post challenging?
The most challenging aspect of the post is ____________.','Nurse 1: How are you finding the surgical ward? Nurse 2: The clinical team is wonderful, and the patient documentation is straightforward. But having to rotate through back-to-back night shifts is truly exhausting—it completely disrupts my sleep rhythm.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','d990f859-f99f-4c74-971d-429ab3575e36','set6'),(1260,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to an announcement in a home improvement center. Which department features the biggest discounts this weekend?
This weekend, the highest discounts are on ____________.','Store Announcer: Welcome to Apex Home Center! This weekend only, take advantage of store-wide clearance prices. While power tools and paint supplies are ten percent off, our biggest reductions are on outdoor patio furniture, slashed by up to fifty percent!',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','5d17c3fb-4870-4362-89c6-40e1a38faf10','set6'),(1261,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to the radio commercial for a new neighborhood market. Who is the market primarily designed for?
The new market is tailored for shoppers seeking ____________.','Commercial: Introducing Green Valley Market, open daily on Elm Street! If you\'re passionate about supporting local growers and serving wholesome organic local produce free from synthetic pesticides, visit our fresh farm stalls today!',NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','null','69d6504d-ea24-4638-ac1e-34c08d310943','set6'),(1262,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Four people are talking about their daily commutes to work. Complete the sentences.','Speaker A: I take the express subway train right into the central station. It\'s crowded, but it bypasses morning traffic completely and takes exactly twenty minutes.
Speaker B: I cycle through the city park\'s dedicated bicycle paths. It\'s refreshing, energizing, and keeps me fit before work.
Speaker C: Three colleagues and I take turns driving each week in a carpool. Sharing fuel costs and chatting on the commute makes the trip enjoyable.
Speaker D: I drive my own car, but I leave home at six in the morning when the highway is totally quiet and empty.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc','set6'),(1263,2,'MCQ','a. Speaker A: ____',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc','set6'),(1264,2,'MCQ','b. Speaker B: ____',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc','set6'),(1265,2,'MCQ','c. Speaker C: ____',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc','set6'),(1266,2,'MCQ','d. Speaker D: ____',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','6a4267c7-9791-4779-b8f3-dd954f22c8fc','set6'),(1267,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two people talking about working remotely from home versus working in a central office. Who expresses these opinions?','Man: Personally, I find that resolving intricate design challenges happens far faster when colleagues are seated in the same room. Face-to-face interaction avoids misunderstandings. However, I have to admit that avoiding a ninety-minute commute every day saves an enormous amount of mental fatigue.
Woman: I agree completely about the commute—both of us clearly appreciate reclaiming personal time. But from an organizational standpoint, junior employees miss out on informal guidance and spontaneous mentoring when everyone works isolated from home. Still, modern video conferencing software makes day-to-day coordination remarkably seamless, so hybrid arrangements strike the right balance.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a','set6'),(1268,2,'MCQ','Face-to-face discussions resolve complex issues faster',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a','set6'),(1269,2,'MCQ','Eliminating daily commuting significantly reduces personal fatigue',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a','set6'),(1270,2,'MCQ','Junior employees gain immense value from spontaneous mentoring',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a','set6'),(1271,2,'MCQ','Virtual video tools have made team coordination highly effective',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','9dd4f6fe-9b97-4cb5-ba02-0e1b7689b42a','set6'),(1272,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a travel reviewer on the radio talking about a self-guided hiking trip in the Scottish Highlands.','Reviewer: When I embarked on the five-day West Highland hiking trail, I expected a gradual trek. However, the physical demands varied considerably each day. Monday\'s gentle lakeside paths gave way to brutal, boulder-strewn mountain passes on Wednesday that tested even seasoned trekkers. In general, self-guided trekking is magnificent, but hikers severely underestimate how much navigational preparation is required. Relying solely on mobile GPS in deep glens with zero cell reception is a recipe for disaster; you must be proficient with a topographical map and magnetic compass.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','fa7eb51c-6d47-4ada-a794-2c6459b888cb','set6'),(1273,2,'MCQ','What is the reviewer\'s opinion of the trail difficulty?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','fa7eb51c-6d47-4ada-a794-2c6459b888cb','set6'),(1274,2,'MCQ','What is the reviewer\'s overall view of remote self-guided trekking?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','fa7eb51c-6d47-4ada-a794-2c6459b888cb','set6'),(1275,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a commercial building engineer on the radio talking about energy management in modern eco-friendly offices.','Engineer: When businesses evaluate their energy consumption, they often focus on high-profile investments like rooftop solar arrays or triple-glazed windows. Yet in our audits, we find that automating climate control schedules yields the single greatest reduction in energy waste. Simply programming heating and cooling units to shut down automatically thirty minutes before offices empty cuts consumption dramatically. Regarding environmental certifications, many rating systems focus too heavily on symbolic gestures and costly paperwork rather than verifiable kilowatt reductions. Practical monitoring is what truly saves energy.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','d796f5cc-bd0b-4a1d-97db-816b8f37d93b','set6'),(1276,2,'MCQ','What does the engineer identify as the single most critical factor in reducing energy waste?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','d796f5cc-bd0b-4a1d-97db-816b8f37d93b','set6'),(1277,2,'MCQ','What is the engineer\'s view regarding green building certifications?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','d796f5cc-bd0b-4a1d-97db-816b8f37d93b','set6'),(1278,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a fitness club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','8b7a6896-5991-4c2c-ab3b-8304b0aac67d','set6'),(1279,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite sport?',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','8b7a6896-5991-4c2c-ab3b-8304b0aac67d','set6'),(1280,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What exercise did you do yesterday?',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','8b7a6896-5991-4c2c-ab3b-8304b0aac67d','set6'),(1281,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What\'s your favourite workout time?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','8b7a6896-5991-4c2c-ab3b-8304b0aac67d','set6'),(1282,3,'WRITING_PRO