',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "If you intend to invite external contractors to the facility, please follow these guidelines.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before visitors can proceed past the main turnstiles, they must hold a valid host clearance slip.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can complete this pre-registration form through the front desk portal before arrival.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our automated kiosk will issue one of these visitor slips once host verification is confirmed.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon presenting government identification, your visitor will receive an official pass lanyard.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please ensure the temporary badge is clearly pinned to your guest\'s jacket while inside the building.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you intend to invite external contractors to the facility, please follow these guidelines.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','6b1629ab-b226-4f21-9949-e82de4fcce2c','set6'),(1302,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','092ede03-fdb0-4f1e-9d61-7c0b8d86b581','set6'),(1303,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','traditional leather crafting

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "In traditional leatherwork, artisans follow a disciplined procedure for preparing and saddle-stitching hides.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The craftsman begins by carefully inspecting full-grain hides to remove irregular surface blemishes.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their selection of natural vegetable tannins is vital because chemical concentrations alter leather suppleness.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Novice leatherworkers must grasp how each tool angle and thread tension determine joint durability.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This heritage method enables makers to produce flexible, watertight seams that outlast machine stitching.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can practice these hand-grooving skills during seasonal masterclasses held in south Wales.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In traditional leatherwork, artisans follow a disciplined procedure for preparing and saddle-stitching hides.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','092ede03-fdb0-4f1e-9d61-7c0b8d86b581','set6'),(1304,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1305,4,'QUESTION_FORM','the city\'s newly opened municipal sports and aquatic complex',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1306,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person A

The main setback in this facility is the severe lack of clear schedule signage. The few monitors they installed flicker constantly, leaving swimmers confused about open lane hours. This chaos intensifies during afternoon youth training sessions. I still commute here because the regional gym across the district is overpriced. Half of the spectator lockers are out of order, so the team should dismantle them and introduce digital self-service key racks instead.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1307,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person B

Most of the changing room benches near the diving pool are damp, splintered, and worn. The leisure board should replace them with water-resistant composite benches and tighten the shaky stainless-steel grab bars as well. The hydrotherapy zone is maintained nicely, but the warning cards go missing all the time. Management needs an attendant stationed there full-time. Having four receptionists chatting casually behind the turnstiles is an irresponsible misuse of community staffing funds.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1308,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person C

I find it quite frustrating to find my way through the interconnected corridors. The zone numbering makes little sense, and directional arrows are frequently covered by large promotional banners. Additionally, the lap pool is positioned directly adjacent to the boiler filtration pumps, which ought to operate with minimal noise. It is overwhelmingly loud whenever the secondary heating pumps activate. The walkways between courts are far too narrow, leaving zero room to stop and stretch without blocking traffic.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1309,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person D

I have always appreciated having this sports hub available. Ever since my junior competitive swimming days, it served as an ideal venue to practice and gather workout metrics. I continue visiting thrice a week to utilize the Olympic lanes and check my digital lap telemetry. The pool water quality is superb, but the facility suffers from an acute lack of mechanical upkeep workers. I notice this every time chlorine metering sensors fail or the electronic timers trip. There is never a repair specialist on duty when technical breakdowns occur, which happens regularly.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1310,4,'MCQ','(\'16\', \'Who thinks the sports complex requires a larger technical maintenance staff?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1311,4,'MCQ','(\'17\', \'Who wants malfunctioning storage fixtures replaced with automated modern units?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1312,4,'MCQ','(\'18\', \'Who thinks the corridor signs and directional floor markers need clearer arrangement?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1313,4,'MCQ','(\'19\', \'Who thinks the changing area furniture and poolside safety rails need renewal?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1314,4,'MCQ','(\'20\', \'Who notes that a peaceful workout environment is ruined by loud mechanical equipment?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1315,4,'MCQ','(\'21\', \'Who regularly experiences malfunctions with electronic performance and monitoring equipment?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1316,4,'MCQ','(\'22\', \'Who visits the sports complex specifically to conduct rigorous personal training routines?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','07e9dd55-fb7f-49ac-ac77-4faec1b5d71b','set6'),(1317,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading from the list for each numbered paragraph. There is one heading that you do not need. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1318,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The Panama Canal Project',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1319,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:

Engineers initially debated whether a sea-level cut or an elevated lock system offered the most viable blueprint across the continental divide. Chief planners recognized that torrential rains and swelling river basins would make an unrestricted sea-level trench continually prone to collapse. Critics countered that constructing colossal concrete lock chambers and damming torrential rivers was impractical and dangerous. Planners insisted that a lock-and-lake system could safely regulate water volumes while handling massive transport vessels. This mechanical doctrine became the foundational blueprint for construction.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1320,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:

The landscape underwent extreme reconfiguration as steam shovels and dynamite carved deep chasms through solid volcanic basalt. Specialized dredging equipment cleared millions of cubic yards of mud from tropical riverbeds. Miles of temporary rail lines were laid to haul excavation rubble across treacherous slopes. Workers lived under spartan conditions in hastily erected barracks, requiring unprecedented supply logistics. Fleets of freight ships delivered tens of thousands of concrete barrels, structural steel gates, heavy steam boilers, and preserved rations to feed the enormous workforce.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1321,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:

A specialized medical corps—comprising epidemiologists, sanitary inspectors, and laboratory technicians—was assembled under military medical command. Their essential task involved eradicating the deadly outbreaks of yellow fever and malaria that had decimated previous French efforts. Armed with fumigation sprayers, window screens, and oil treatments for stagnant pools, this health division transformed the deadly jungle corridor into a habitable industrial zone.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1322,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:

Excavation reached its peak at the formidable Culebra Cut, where unstable earthen mountains continually slid into freshly dug trenches. Unpredictable rockslides obliterated railbeds and crushed heavy machinery overnight, yet work resumed after each disaster without pause. By the summer of 1913, the primary excavations linked both sides of the isthmus, and water was released to fill Gatun Lake. In August 1914, the cargo steamship SS Ancon made the historic maiden crossing, successfully navigating the locks just as international tensions escalated into global conflict.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1323,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:

The completion of the canal provoked both international acclaim and sharp economic debates among trading nations. Some European shippers complained about steep transit tolls and questioned whether the project justified its immense financial and human toll. Others argued that the operational schedule favored specific geopolitical routes. However, global trade figures soon demonstrated that the shortcut slashed thousands of ocean miles, permanently transforming global supply lines.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1324,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:

In the decades following the canal’s opening, maritime authorities implemented continuous structural expansions to accommodate ever-growing vessel dimensions. Later engineering teams deepened channels, installed computer-guided towing locomotives, and constructed massive third-lane locks. Modern marine historians frequently retrace these construction feats through archival photographs, documenting the human endurance required to conquer the continental barrier.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1325,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:

The dramatic story of the canal’s creation has endured as an icon of twentieth-century technological achievement. Countless documentaries, engineering treatises, and historic exhibits recount the epic scale of the excavation. Today, the canal remains under sovereign Panamanian administration, safeguarded as an indispensable artery of international commerce and a globally recognized historic landmark.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','5a6b3500-f13e-43f3-a015-4bdcda53c9d1','set6'),(1326,5,'MCQ','She wants to buy ____________ new umbrella before the rainy season begins.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1327,5,'MCQ','There isn\'t _____________ sugar remaining in the kitchen canister.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1328,5,'MCQ','This modern laptop is significantly faster _________ the previous model.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1329,5,'MCQ','I ________ enjoy strolling along the waterfront at sunset.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1330,5,'MCQ','Our department __________ to launch the new software platform next spring.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1331,5,'MCQ','If he __________ the early train, he will be late for the client briefing.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1332,5,'MCQ','The entire audience was thoroughly __________ by the magician\'s finale.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1333,5,'MCQ','She doesn\'t ___________ drink coffee after eight o\'clock in the evening.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1334,5,'MCQ','Have you ever ___________ a real hot-air balloon over the valley?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1335,5,'MCQ','You ___________ present your identification badge at the security gate.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1336,5,'MCQ','The technician managed ___________ the broken server within two hours.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set6'),(1337,5,'MCQ','_______________ was cho