The man wants to purchase ____________.','Customer: Hello, I\'m shopping for a coffee machine for my home kitchen. I\'m not interested in plastic pod capsules, and manual filters take too long before work. I\'m looking for a programmable espresso machine that grinds beans and foams milk automatically.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','af5cd7ea-39f5-4721-9911-47b94b9a9abb','set7'),(1445,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a tenant discussing her rented cottage. What does she dislike about it?
