Speaker D: On Saturdays and Sundays, I play competitive five-a-side football with a local community league.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654','set7'),(1452,2,'MCQ','a. Speaker A: ____',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654','set7'),(1453,2,'MCQ','b. Speaker B: ____',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654','set7'),(1454,2,'MCQ','c. Speaker C: ____',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654','set7'),(1455,2,'MCQ','d. Speaker D: ____',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','a466fe0c-772a-4d72-ba87-98250b8b2654','set7'),(1456,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two people talking about shopping online versus buying in physical high-street stores. Who expresses these opinions?','Man: Online marketplaces are incredible for product discovery—you have access to an infinitely broader catalogue of goods than any shopping mall could stock. But returning a defective item by postal courier is tedious. In physical shops, returning an item is instant and straightforward.
Woman: That catalogue advantage is indisputable, but you simply cannot judge fabric texture or shoe fit on a screen; brick-and-mortar shops let you inspect physical quality directly. Furthermore, browsing high-street stores with friends provides an enjoyable social atmosphere that shopping alone on a phone can never replicate.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc','set7'),(1457,2,'MCQ','Returning defective goods is much simpler and faster in person',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc','set7'),(1458,2,'MCQ','Online platforms provide an infinitely broader catalogue of goods',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc','set7'),(1459,2,'MCQ','Brick-and-mortar shops enable customers to verify physical product quality',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc','set7'),(1460,2,'MCQ','Visiting high-street shops provides an enjoyable social atmosphere',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','95d38182-2460-4351-9b7e-86ba96b2c0dc','set7'),(1461,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a culinary critic on the radio reviewing a newly opened organic farm-to-table restaurant.','Critic: The newly unveiled seasonal tasting menu at The Wild Thyme was a triumph. The balance of acidity, earthy forest herbs, and delicate wood-smoked trout demonstrated extraordinary culinary refinement without feeling heavy or pretentious. Turning to the wider restaurant landscape, while farm-to-table dining has popularized sustainable gastronomy, many suburban venues use the label purely for marketing without genuine local sourcing. Conscientious diners should look beyond promotional buzzwords and ask where ingredients actually come from.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','9826ffa3-9f92-4e8e-8d6e-b27a51f1255c','set7'),(1462,2,'MCQ','What is the critic\'s opinion of the seasonal tasting menu?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','9826ffa3-9f92-4e8e-8d6e-b27a51f1255c','set7'),(1463,2,'MCQ','What is the critic\'s overall view of the farm-to-table dining trend?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','9826ffa3-9f92-4e8e-8d6e-b27a51f1255c','set7'),(1464,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a university career counselor on the radio talking about undergraduate corporate internship schemes.','Counselor: When undergraduates embark on corporate internships, they often expect to spend months mastering theoretical software. In truth, gaining exposure to realistic workplace problem-solving—collaborating under pressure, prioritizing ambiguous deadlines, and communicating across hierarchies—is the single most transformative takeaway. In modern graduate recruitment, employers value demonstrated adaptability far more than perfect academic transcripts. A candidate who can pivot when an unexpected crisis emerges will always stand out.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','97379c50-13cd-43c6-9391-2b94fae2c024','set7'),(1465,2,'MCQ','What does the counselor view as the most valuable element of a student internship?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','97379c50-13cd-43c6-9391-2b94fae2c024','set7'),(1466,2,'MCQ','What is the counselor\'s view regarding graduate recruitment trends?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','97379c50-13cd-43c6-9391-2b94fae2c024','set7'),(1467,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a photography club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1468,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What kind of camera do you use?',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1469,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What did you photograph last weekend?',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1470,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite time to take pictures?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1471,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','How often do you edit your photos?',NULL,NULL,5,4,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1472,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Where would you like to travel next for photography?',NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL,'click','null','d1b03484-99a9-41d5-b960-da6f146f5345','set7'),(1473,3,'QUESTION_FORM','the photography club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','b54be639-e348-4ea2-ab31-a9bb80366514','set7'),(1474,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Please write some reasons why you are interested in joining a photography club.',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','b54be639-e348-4ea2-ab31-a9bb80366514','set7'),(1475,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a photography club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','1f931ab5-00f8-49eb-81f9-2d398626ec4a','set7'),(1476,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Master Photographer Alan: Hi! Welcome to the club. Can you remember the first meaningful photograph you ever took? What made it memorable?',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','1f931ab5-00f8-49eb-81f9-2d398626ec4a','set7'),(1477,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Maya: Welcome! What are the most photogenic outdoor locations or architectural sights in your city?',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','1f931ab5-00f8-49eb-81f9-2d398626ec4a','set7'),(1478,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Daniel: What is the most challenging photography technique or camera setting you have ever tried to master?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','1f931ab5-00f8-49eb-81f9-2d398626ec4a','set7'),(1479,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a photography club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d94c4ab0-f5b2-45a2-a445-fc051f083071','set7'),(1480,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear member,
