 elevators at [blank] 3 o’clock.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','a291dc98-848d-4b8f-86fa-d19ed7107eca','set7'),(1489,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from a report. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','ae3607b2-3f5b-43c6-a418-21f5f9b26dd2','set7'),(1490,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','an internal company vehicle guide

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "If you require a fleet vehicle for regional business travel, please note this reservation process.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before you can take custody of any company car, you must possess an approved travel manifest.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can complete this trip request online through the staff intranet at least two days in advance.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our transport management portal will assign an available vehicle once managerial authorization is uploaded.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon presenting your driver\'s credentials, the transport dispatcher will hand over the ignition keys and fuel card.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please park the returned car in its designated bay and place the keys into the security drop-box.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you require a fleet vehicle for regional business travel, please note this reservation process.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','ae3607b2-3f5b-43c6-a418-21f5f9b26dd2','set7'),(1491,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','6300c976-95fa-4c28-a1bc-7ceebd29501d','set7'),(1492,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','artisanal coffee cultivation and processing

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "In artisanal coffee production, there is a delicate method of wet-fermenting hand-picked cherries.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The farmer begins by selectively picking only deep crimson cherries from highland shrubs.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their choice of fermentation tanks is crucial because varying ambient temperatures alter enzyme activity.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Roasters must understand how drying times and moisture levels influence bean development.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This careful washing process allows producers to preserve bright acidity and floral notes in the bean.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Agronomy students can observe these wet-milling techniques during field clinics in central Colombia.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In artisanal coffee production, there is a delicate method of wet-fermenting hand-picked cherries.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','6300c976-95fa-4c28-a1bc-7ceebd29501d','set7'),(1493,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1494,4,'QUESTION_FORM','the city\'s newly launched public bicycle-sharing program',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1495,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person A

The primary problem with this bike initiative is the lack of visible informational kiosks at busy stations. The existing digital maps are tiny, and riders spend minutes searching for nearby drop-off docks. The confusion gets intolerable during morning peak hours. I use the service regularly because cross-town bus fares are expensive. Several docking plazas have clusters of damaged, abandoned frames, so the agency should scrap them and install interactive touchscreen return terminals instead.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1496,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person B

Most of the bike saddles and hand grips on the older commuter units are cracked and worn down. The operators should swap out those parts with weather-proof materials and tighten the wobbly handlebar brake levers too. The electric-assist cruisers are great to ride, but the safety instruction tags are continually missing. You need an attendant at terminal hubs to keep bikes aligned. Having four municipal marshals standing around the central plaza checking phones is an outright waste of public transit funding.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1497,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person C

I find the lane layout and docking station numbering remarkably confusing. Station codes do not follow sequential street addresses, and road signage is often hidden by roadside construction hoardings. Moreover, the main docking station near the metro station is placed right beside the high-volume ventilation shafts, which are supposed to run quietly. The whirring noise is deafening when exhaust blowers cycle on. The access paths around the docks are too narrow, giving no room to stand or adjust helmets safely.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1498,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person D

I have always supported urban cycling. Ever since my university days, bicycling has been my preferred method to collect environmental data and commute. I still ride these share-bikes daily to survey traffic patterns and test mobile commuter apps. The fleet coverage is fantastic, but there is an acute deficit of on-ground technicians. I encounter this whenever mechanical gear cables snap or digital dock locks freeze. There is never a repair mechanic around to service broken bikes, which fail on a regular basis.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1499,4,'MCQ','(\'16\', \'Who emphasizes that the cycling scheme needs a larger team of on-site service mechanics?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1500,4,'MCQ','(\'17\', \'Who wants derelict bike stands cleared away to make room for interactive digital terminals?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1501,4,'MCQ','(\'18\', \'Who thinks the docking station codes and street-level directional signs are poorly arranged?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1502,4,'MCQ','(\'19\', \'Who thinks the bike components and brake fixtures require physical renovation?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1503,4,'MCQ','(\'20\', \'Who notes that docking stops are disturbed by excessively loud industrial ventilation?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1504,4,'MCQ','(\'21\', \'Who experiences regular mechanical breakdowns and docking lock malfunctions during daily use?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1505,4,'MCQ','(\'22\', \'Who uses the public bike network primarily to assist with personal research and survey work?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','143ceaf2-5afc-405f-bd72-df92715a6f86','set7'),(1506,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading from the list for each numbered paragraph. There is one heading that you do not need. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1507,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The Voyage of HMS Beagle',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1508,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:

Captain FitzRoy believed that an extensive coastal survey could produce infallible maritime charts while accumulating geological evidence supporting biblical creation. He maintained that accurate chronological measurements using precision chronometers would revolutionize navigation. However, academic skeptics warned that embarking on a prolonged voyage aboard an overcrowded vessel was exceedingly risky. They insisted that erratic Pacific currents and harsh coastal gales would inevitably endanger the vessel. FitzRoy held firm that meticulous hydrographic surveying could unlock safe sea lanes.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1509,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:

The vessel had been extensively modified prior to departure, receiving an extra upper deck and copper sheathing along the wooden hull to resist tropical shipworms. Because of its small dimensions, every cubic foot was strictly allocated. The quarters were remarkably confined, forcing officers and scientists to sleep in hammocks slung among survey equipment. Immense provisions were stowed below: casks of salted beef, barrels of ship’s biscuits, lemon juice to ward off scurvy, and specialized packaging materials for preserving animal and plant specimens.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1510,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:

The specialized onboard surveying team—consisting of draftsmen, seasoned navigators, an instrument technician, and Darwin himself—worked with focused discipline. Their scientific inventory was advanced for the era, encompassing marine chronometers, compound microscopes, geological hammers, and chemical jars, which Darwin used continuously to record rock strata and catalog terrestrial specimens.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1511,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:

The ship navigated violent equatorial squalls before surveying the rugged contours of the South American coastline over several arduous years. Long inland expeditions across the Argentine pampas and the Andes Mountains yielded fossils of colossal extinct mammals. By the autumn of 1835, the Beagle reached the isolated Galápagos archipelago. Here Darwin collected diverse mockingbirds, finches, and giant tortoises, noting subtle physical variations across nearby islands before the ship commenced its Pacific crossing and returned home in 1836.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1512,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:

Darwin’s return generated immediate enthusiasm alongside sharp scientific disagreements within Victorian academies. Conservative geologists questioned his radical deductions regarding gradual land uplift and fossil distribution. Others disputed his anatomical classifications of island fauna. Nevertheless, leading taxonomists verified that Darwin’s specimens represented distinct, previously unclassified species, prompting scientists to rethink the permanence of biological forms.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1513,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:

In the decades following the Beagle’s return, subsequent survey expeditions revisited South American waters using steam-powered vessels and modern sounding apparatus. Modern marine biologists have repeatedly retraced the Beagle’s exact sea coordinates to examine ecological transformations, producing celebrated scientific television series highlighting Darwin’s route.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1514,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:

The legacy of the Beagle voyage has left an indelible mark on intellectual history. Darwin’s captivating travel diary, The Voyage of the Beagle, was published in 1839 and became an enduring international classic. His later evolutionary thesis transformed global science. Today, replicas of the vessel and preserved specimen collections housed in national museums continue to inspire researchers around the world.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','caf412a0-5136-421e-a2f7-41efa2f270d7','set7'),(1515,5,'MCQ','He usually eats ____________ apple as a mid-morning snack.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1516,5,'MCQ','Are there _____________ clean glasses left in the cupboard?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1517,5,'MCQ','The express train is much quicker _________ the local commuter bus.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1518,5,'MCQ','She ________ dislikes driving through heavy downtown traffic.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1519,5,'MCQ','They __________ to relocate to another branch next autumn.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1520,5,'MCQ','If it __________ tomorrow morning, the outdoor match will be postponed.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1521,5,'MCQ','The tourists were utterly __________ after hiking up the mountain.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1522,5,'MCQ','He doesn\'t ___________ watch television on weekdays.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1523,5,'MCQ','Have you ever ___________ an original oil painting in a gallery?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1524,5,'MCQ','Employees ___________ submit their expense receipts by Friday afternoon.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1525,5,'MCQ','She managed ___________ her dissertation two days ahead of schedule.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set7'),(1526,5,'MCQ','_______________ discovered the security flaw in the payment system?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,