In the morning, Edward always drinks ____________.','Miriam: Hi Laura, just returning your call about Dad\'s morning routine while you\'re house-sitting. He enjoys reading the paper with a warm beverage, but he never touches tea or juice. He drinks a large mug of black filter coffee every morning without fail.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','3b0bf78c-ac08-4702-895a-3c25de8bc463','set8'),(1630,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Vanessa calls to announce a shift in the corporate training workshop. What day will the workshop be held?
