Leo misplaced his ____________.','Leo: Hello, front desk? This is Leo Henderson from Room 408. I checked out two hours ago and arrived at the airport, only to find that my leather passport holder is missing from my coat. I think I left it inside the top desk drawer. Could security check immediately?',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','6cf021c2-2f4d-4378-9504-4272cc970251','set8'),(1632,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two colleagues deciding on their Friday evening outing. What do they choose to do?
The colleagues choose to ____________.','Colleague 1: Are you up for going to that contemporary gallery opening tonight? Colleague 2: To be honest, I\'ve had a mentally draining week and just want something lighthearted. How about catching that new comedy film at the downtown cinema? Colleague 1: That sounds perfect, let\'s get tickets.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','c5a569e8-c180-4546-a8a1-be7bbda996ed','set8'),(1633,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a customer in an electronics boutique. What type of monitor does she want to purchase?
