He is planning to remove the ____________.','Homeowner: The garden has beautiful mature fruit trees, but the previous owner erected this massive decaying wooden deck that has begun rotting and attracting termites. I\'ve hired a contractor to tear it down and replace it with natural flagstone pavers.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','cbdc5cc2-01ce-46a9-adee-b219b2c329c1','set8'),(1635,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a local council announcement. Whose retirement gala is taking place in October?
