The commercial complex is designed for businesses seeking ____________.','Commercial: Introducing Nexus Hub, the district\'s newest commercial development! Built specifically for emerging tech enterprises seeking flexible collaborative workspaces with high-speed fiber infrastructure, private meeting pods, and modular lease terms.',NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','null','e889479c-fc3e-4825-8fb2-b4ce2cf3896a','set8'),(1640,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Four people are talking about how they spend their annual vacation leave. Complete the sentences.','Speaker A: I love historical architecture and culture, so every summer I book guided walking tours through ancient European capitals.
