Speaker C: I spend my vacations trekking solo through alpine wilderness, carrying my tent and climbing gear over remote mountain passes.
Speaker D: Every summer, I volunteer for three weeks on a sea turtle conservation reserve, monitoring nesting sites along coastal beaches.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85','set8'),(1641,2,'MCQ','a. Speaker A: ____',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85','set8'),(1642,2,'MCQ','b. Speaker B: ____',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85','set8'),(1643,2,'MCQ','c. Speaker C: ____',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85','set8'),(1644,2,'MCQ','d. Speaker D: ____',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','ed9943d0-e7ae-4e0d-ba82-7a3996ff7e85','set8'),(1645,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two people talking about traditional public libraries versus modern digital e-readers. Who expresses these opinions?','Man: There\'s an undeniable treasure in municipal libraries—their physical archives preserve local historical manuscripts and maps that simply cannot be digitized. But when traveling for business, digital e-readers offer unbeatable convenience; carrying fifty books on a lightweight slate is extraordinary.
Woman: I agree that e-readers are a marvel for traveling, but public libraries foster social cohesion in neighborhoods that no electronic bookstore can replicate. That said, instant digital borrowing on e-readers has undeniably prompted people to read far more frequently than when they had to wait for library opening hours.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','0340a42b-e991-4f57-bcd9-f570f421c972','set8'),(1646,2,'MCQ','Borrowing printed books strengthens neighborhood community bonds',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','0340a42b-e991-4f57-bcd9-f570f421c972','set8'),(1647,2,'MCQ','Digital reading devices offer unbeatable convenience during long journeys',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','0340a42b-e991-4f57-bcd9-f570f421c972','set8'),(1648,2,'MCQ','Local library collections preserve rare archival documents unavailable online',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','0340a42b-e991-4f57-bcd9-f570f421c972','set8'),(1649,2,'MCQ','Immediate access to electronic titles significantly increases reading frequency',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','0340a42b-e991-4f57-bcd9-f570f421c972','set8'),(1650,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to an arts correspondent on the radio reviewing an interactive immersive projection exhibition.','Arts Correspondent: Stepping into the digital gallery space at the Light Pavilion was an astonishing experience. The seamless architectural mapping of Van Gogh\'s brushstrokes across forty-foot curved walls created a breathtaking sensory world that made visitors feel immersed inside the paintings themselves. However, as an arts critic, I cannot overlook the broader trend. Too many interactive exhibitions prioritize superficial spectacle and selfie backdrops over genuine artistic depth and curation. Spectacle without historical context leaves audiences dazzled but unenlightened.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','e5fbe85b-3ba6-437f-9c12-c8270cf5c71c','set8'),(1651,2,'MCQ','What is the correspondent\'s opinion of the visual projection technology?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','e5fbe85b-3ba6-437f-9c12-c8270cf5c71c','set8'),(1652,2,'MCQ','What is the correspondent\'s overall view of digital immersive exhibits?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','e5fbe85b-3ba6-437f-9c12-c8270cf5c71c','set8'),(1653,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to an international conference director on the radio discussing the organization of global corporate conventions.','Conference Director: Orchestrating an international corporate summit with delegates arriving from forty countries requires immense operational discipline. While speakers and venues draw headlines, establishing redundant digital streaming infrastructure is the single most vital logistical priority—if your satellite feed drops during a global announcement, the entire convention fails. Looking at hybrid event design, organizers must realize that engaging remote delegates requires completely different presentation formats than live stage talks. An online audience loses attention after twenty minutes of a podium monologue; you must weave interactive polling and breakout hubs into the digital broadcast.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','9a61475e-6eb5-4b95-bd81-16349bdd7cf9','set8'),(1654,2,'MCQ','What does the director consider the most vital element of large-scale event logistics?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','9a61475e-6eb5-4b95-bd81-16349bdd7cf9','set8'),(1655,2,'MCQ','What is the director\'s perspective regarding hybrid virtual-and-physical events?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','9a61475e-6eb5-4b95-bd81-16349bdd7cf9','set8'),(1656,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a book club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1657,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite book genre?',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1658,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What book did you finish recently?',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1659,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Where do you usually like to read?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1660,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','How many books do you read each month?',NULL,NULL,5,4,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1661,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Do you prefer paper books or e-books?',NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL,'click','null','d5c7962c-2aa0-4aa1-b859-1149d07109cf','set8'),(1662,3,'QUESTION_FORM','the book club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','3b5eb8d8-3055-4cb6-ae92-3f2db31c4da1','set8'),(1663,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Please write some reasons why you are interested in joining a book club.',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','3b5eb8d8-3055-4cb6-ae92-3f2db31c4da1','set8'),(1664,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a book club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d7b58751-72df-4029-8e5c-52e555d1b97e','set8'),(1665,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Moderator Claire: Hello and welcome! Can you tell us about a book that made a strong emotional impact on you? Why was it so powerful?',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','d7b58751-72df-4029-8e5c-52e555d1b97e','set8'),(1666,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Ethan: Welcome to our group! What is your favourite quiet library, cafe, or outdoor spot for reading in town?',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','d7b58751-72df-4029-8e5c-52e555d1b97e','set8'),(1667,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Priya: What is the most challenging or lengthy literary novel you have ever read from start to finish?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','d7b58751-72df-4029-8e5c-52e555d1b97e','set8'),(1668,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a book club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','9f17d199-9710-4313-9db0-cebb4b67df1e','set8'),(1669,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear member,
We regret to announce that the award-winning historical fiction author, Dr. Arthur Campbell, will unfortunately not be able to attend our upcoming annual literary dinner and discussion evening due to severe international flight cancellations. Although Dr. Campbell cannot deliver his keynote address in person, club members will have the exclusive opportunity to purchase a collector\'s hardcover edition of his latest novel, featuring a personalized bookplate, for the discounted price of 20 dollars. To reserve your copy, please contact the club organizer.',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','9f17d199-9710-4313-9db0-cebb4b67df1e','set8'),(1670,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 1: Write an email to your friend. Write about your feelings and what you would like to do. Write about 50 words. You have 10 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','9f17d199-9710-4313-9db0-cebb4b67df1e','set8'),(1671,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 2: Write an email to the organizer. Explain your feelings about the notice and say what you would like the club to do. Write 120-150 words. You have 20 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','9f17d199-9710-4313-9db0-cebb4b67df1e','set8'),(1672,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the email given below. Choose one word from the drop-down list for each gap. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1673,4,'MCQ','We need [blank] laminated badges for the guest speakers.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1674,4,'MCQ','Don’t [blank] to hand over the audio credentials to the technician.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1675,4,'MCQ','The logistics desk [blank] early on Tuesdays.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1676,4,'MCQ','I have an introductory briefing scheduled in the hospitality [blank].',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1677,4,'MCQ','I will meet you at the south entrance at [blank] 2 o’clock.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','3a55e2b1-d31e-4f84-9684-f9c7b986e107','set8'),(1678,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from a report. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','acea48b4-a015-4f8a-a912-3fcc12605127','set8'),(1679,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','an archival document destruction protocol

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "If you intend to dispose of confidential client dossiers, please adhere to these security steps.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before you can transport any sensitive files to the shredding bay, you must secure an official destruction clearance.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can initiate this disposal request on the internal records database during business hours.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our central compliance software will log an approved destruction order once legal review confirms eligibility.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon presenting your compliance authorization, the archives manager will release the designated secure bin.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please lock the mobile disposal bin immediately with your supervisor\'s tamper-evident security seal.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you intend to dispose of confidential client dossiers, please adhere to these security steps.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','acea48b4-a015-4f8a-a912-3fcc12605127','set8'),(1680,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','db4f3b5a-10c2-425b-933c-3a5d72e0280d','set8'),(1681,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','lost-wax bronze casting

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "In traditional bronze sculpture, there is an intricate method of lost-wax casting practiced since antiquity.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The sculptor begins by modeling an original clay core coated with a pliable wax outer layer.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their choice of refractory ceramic slurry is critical because weak mold shells fracture under intense heat.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Apprentice sculptors must comprehend how molten metal cooling rates and air venting systems interact.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This ancient technique enables artists to capture exquisite surface details impossible with stone carving.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can master these gating and chasing skills at specialized foundry studios in northern Italy.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In traditional bronze sculpture, there is an intricate method of lost-wax casting practiced since antiquity.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','db4f3b5a-10c2-425b-933c-3a5d72e0280d','set8'),(1682,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1683,4,'QUESTION_FORM','the city\'s newly opened innovation and coworking hub',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1684,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person A

The biggest drawback in this coworking space is the complete lack of room directory signage. The few electronic boards they set up are regularly frozen, leaving visiting clients wandering aimlessly looking for meeting suites. It becomes intolerable during investor demo days. I still rent a desk here because private office leases downtown are exorbitant. Half of the hot desks in the east wing are broken, so the operators should remove them and put in interactive touchscreen booking kiosks instead.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1685,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person B

Most of the ergonomic desk chairs in the open study room are wobbly and deteriorating. The facility managers should swap them for sturdy commercial-grade furniture and repair the loose electrical power-strip housings as well. The podcast recording booth is designed well, but equipment usage manuals keep disappearing. Management needs a staff assistant stationed nearby. Having three desk clerks sitting idle by the lobby entrance playing mobile games is a poor allocation of member subscription funds.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1686,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person C

I find it extremely difficult to find my way around this multi-floor hub. The suite numbering system is completely counter-intuitive, and directional placards are frequently hidden by promotional banners. In addition, the silent focus pod was constructed directly beneath the central air-chiller compressors, which were supposed to operate silently. The rumbling vibration is deafening when the climate compressors kick in. The corridors between collaborative cubicles are far too narrow, leaving no space to step aside and take phone calls.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1687,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person D

I have always been fond of this enterprise facility. Ever since my start-up incubation days, it provided an exceptional venue to analyze market data and hold team workshops. I still drop in daily to review financial analytics and access high-speed research databases. The internet bandwidth is impressive, but there is a severe shortage of on-site IT technicians. I notice this whenever shared cloud printers fail or router hubs lose connectivity. There is never a repair engineer on site to fix hardware problems, which occur continually.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1688,4,'MCQ','(\'16\', \'Who thinks the enterprise hub needs a dedicated on-site IT maintenance team?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1689,4,'MCQ','(\'17\', \'Who recommends removing damaged desks to install automated digital reservation pods?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1690,4,'MCQ','(\'18\', \'Who thinks the floor numbering scheme and room signs are poorly planned?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1691,4,'MCQ','(\'19\', \'Who thinks the office chairs and electrical fixtures need immediate physical repairs?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1692,4,'MCQ','(\'20\', \'Who reports that quiet work zones are disrupted by noisy mechanical cooling machinery?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1693,4,'MCQ','(\'21\', \'Who experiences regular technical breakdowns with shared office hardware and connections?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1694,4,'MCQ','(\'22\', \'Who frequents the innovation hub specifically to conduct data-heavy analytical research?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','c40fd804-0ea8-4c6a-8e7e-1dd8f7305a6f','set8'),(1695,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading from the list for each numbered paragraph. There is one heading that you do not need. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1696,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The First Transcontinental Railroad',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1697,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:

Railroad promoters believed that an overland rail link would bind distant territories together while opening inland commerce across western territories. Prominent civil engineers argued that gradual river grades provided natural rail corridors through mountainous divides. However, skeptical financiers and rival transport lobbies declared that boring tunnels through towering granite ranges was an impossible commercial gamble. They claimed that brutal winter snowstorms and desert heat would inevitably bankrupt the enterprise. Railroad leaders insisted that aggressive mechanical excavation would conquer any barrier.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1698,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:

The rail companies faced massive logistical preparation before laying a single tie. The western line had to ship every locomotive, iron rail, and spike around South America by sea, requiring months of advance planning. The eastern line required colossal supply trains to transport thousands of cords of timber, coal, and dynamite across Nebraska prairies. Temporary construction cities sprang up alongside moving railheads to house thousands of laborers. The crews required tremendous food supplies, consuming immense shipments of salted pork, tinned provisions, and fresh beef driven alongside railhead camps.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1699,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:

The construction workforce—comprising thousands of determined Chinese immigrants on the western route, joined by Irish veterans and freedmen on the eastern plains—was organized with military efficiency. Equipped with black powder, hand drills, horse-drawn scrapers, and surveying transits, specialized grading gangs worked around the clock to blast cliff ledges and grade roadbeds weeks ahead of tracklayers.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1700,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:

Crews confronted extreme hardship crossing the Sierra Nevada mountains, where workers chiseled summit tunnels through solid rock while surviving catastrophic avalanches under thirty-foot snowdrifts. On the eastern plains, tracklayers raced across parched basins under scorching summer heat. Overcoming daunting logistics and hostile terrain, the two railheads converged at Promontory Summit, Utah. On May 10, 1869, a ceremonial golden spike was driven home, reducing a grueling six-month overland journey to just six days.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1701,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:

The celebration following the driving of the Golden Spike was tempered by heated controversy and financial scrutiny. Journalists exposed corrupt financing schemes and fraudulent stock manipulation by railway executives. Land rights advocates criticized the immense government land grants ceded to private rail barons. Nevertheless, commerce statistics soon confirmed that the cross-continental line slashed freight costs and accelerated nationwide settlement, transforming industrial output.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1702,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:

In the decades following the golden spike ceremony, modern rail corporations continually upgraded the historic transcontinental alignment. Engineers replaced wooden trestles with steel viaducts, constructed massive snowsheds, and bored deeper, electrified tunnels to bypass steep grades. Modern transport historians and train enthusiasts frequently retrace the original roadbed, using satellite photography to map surviving grade remnants.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1703,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:

The dramatic story of the transcontinental railroad has captured the historical imagination for over a century. Numerous historical biographies, folk songs, and classic films recount the monumental struggle of the laborers who built the line. Today, the historic meeting point at Promontory Summit is preserved as a national historical park, standing as a testament to pioneer human determination and engineering triumph.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','1369afe2-526d-467d-9315-7dc221d56c05','set8'),(1704,5,'MCQ','He bought ____________ expensive leather briefcase for his new job.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1705,5,'MCQ','There are _____________ biscuits remaining in the tin.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1706,5,'MCQ','The bullet train is far quieter _________ the diesel locomotive.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1707,5,'MCQ','We ________ appreciate all the dedicated assistance you gave us.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1708,5,'MCQ','The management team __________ to restructure the regional offices soon.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1709,5,'MCQ','If the temperature __________ below zero, the lake surface will freeze.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1710,5,'MCQ','The workers were completely __________ by the intense midday heat.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1711,5,'MCQ','She doesn\'t ___________ take sick leave during busy quarters.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1712,5,'MCQ','Have you ever ___________ in a competitive city marathon?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1713,5,'MCQ','All visitors ___________ register at the security desk upon arrival.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1714,5,'MCQ','The mechanic managed ___________ the damaged transmission.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set8'),(1715,5,'MCQ','_______________ authorized this unscheduled expenditure?',NULL,NULL,1,0,N