In the morning, Oliver always eats ____________.','Nora: Hi Auntie May, just returning your message regarding Oliver\'s food preferences while he stays with you. For breakfast, he doesn\'t care for eggs or toast, but he expects a generous bowl of crispy corn flakes with cold milk every morning.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','81a7de9e-7153-4ffa-8bb8-106f09e43645','set9'),(1819,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Melissa calls to notify members about the regional chamber meeting. What day will the meeting be held?
The regional chamber meeting will now be held on ____________.','Melissa: Good morning chamber members, Melissa speaking from the executive committee. Please note that due to an international summit booking at the civic hall on Wednesday, our monthly regional business breakfast has been rescheduled to Thursday at 8.00 am.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','20ed5943-255c-4d92-9475-4f2946201f4c','set9'),(1820,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Felix leaves an audio note for his office manager after traveling. What did he misplace in the auditorium?
Felix misplaced his ____________.','Felix: Hi Brenda, it\'s Felix from technical sales. I gave the keynote pitch in the main auditorium this morning, and I\'ve just realized I left my laptop charging cable plugged into the podium power strip. Could you ask the AV crew to hold it for me?',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','c03fdb14-e685-4939-9592-4e9ffcbac13d','set9'),(1821,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two colleagues discussing an after-work activity. What do they decide to do?
The colleagues decide to ____________.','Colleague 1: Do you feel like heading over to the bowling alley after work today? Colleague 2: The music in there is always so loud! Why don\'t we stroll through the new botanical greenhouse instead? It\'s warm, quiet, and the tropical orchid display just opened. Colleague 1: That sounds wonderful, let\'s go.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','28ec9757-4cf1-456f-b9ef-92abb5664769','set9'),(1822,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a customer in an appliance store. What type of air purifier does she want to purchase?
The customer wants to purchase ____________.','Customer: Hello, I\'m shopping for an air purifier for my child\'s bedroom. She has severe dust allergies, so a simple carbon filter won\'t suffice. I\'m looking for a smart HEPA filter purifier with quiet sleep mode and automated air quality sensors.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','4bd11cf2-9f4a-4612-984a-3c9ffcced852','set9'),(1823,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a homeowner discussing her kitchen renovation. What does she plan to replace?
She is planning to replace the ____________.','Homeowner: Overall, the kitchen layout is spacious and functional, but the previous homeowner installed these dark, unpolished ceramic wall tiles that make the cooking area look dingy. I\'m having a tiler strip them off next week and put up white subway tiles.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','1e45706c-9d75-48e7-b3bb-77932813921b','set9'),(1824,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a community radio bulletin. Whose book launch ceremony is taking place in November?
The author launching a book in November is ____________.','Radio Announcer: Turning to local literary news, the City Arts Council will host a special book launch gala at the Central Library in November. Renowned investigative journalist Arthur Sterling will unveil his highly anticipated historical chronicle of regional shipping.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','e7f2b5a7-ba35-452e-ac8c-0ce9055eea0b','set9'),(1825,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Pamela calls the delivery company about her office furniture shipment. What time will the truck arrive?
The delivery truck is scheduled to arrive at ____________.','Pamela: Hello, Metro Logistics? This is Pamela from Apex Legal. We were advised that our office boardroom chairs would be delivered this morning, but our courier tracker was updated. The logistics coordinator confirmed the delivery truck is scheduled to arrive at 1.45 pm today.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','ff5da0b2-9ee4-442d-bec5-9d272624bb5f','set9'),(1826,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Two hotline operators are discussing their job responsibilities. Why is the position challenging?
The most challenging aspect of the hotline position is ____________.','Operator 1: How are you coping with the customer support desk? Operator 2: Most calls are pleasant, but managing angry callers during system outages is intensely stressful—it requires incredible patience when customers vent their frustration for ten minutes straight.',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','f0c37243-dd66-4077-a414-fc8be1e52ab5','set9'),(1827,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to an in-store broadcast in an outdoor recreation shop. Which category features the best reductions this weekend?
This weekend, the deepest price reductions are on ____________.','Store Broadcast: Welcome to Alpine Sports! Don\'t miss our weekend wilderness sale. While thermal jackets and tents are marked down by twenty percent, our deepest price reductions this weekend are on waterproof hiking boots, slashed by up to fifty percent!',NULL,3,0,NULL,'click','null','c6208b26-2c72-44cb-974e-61e0f4250f1e','set9'),(1828,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a radio commercial for a new neighborhood culinary boutique. Who is the shop designed for?
The new boutique is designed for customers seeking ____________.','Radio Commercial: Are you an enthusiastic home baker looking for premium stoneground French flours, organic vanilla pods, and specialty pastry molds? Visit Sweet Artistry, the neighborhood\'s newest boutique catering specifically to lovers of rare artisanal baking supplies.',NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','null','40e53bad-12dc-4f81-8a8a-8e316ae42166','set9'),(1829,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Four people are talking about how they manage their household budgets and spending. Complete the sentences.','Speaker A: I track every single penny I spend. The moment I buy a coffee or pay a parking meter, I log it immediately into a budgeting app on my phone.
Speaker B: I divide my monthly earnings into physical cash envelopes labeled for groceries, entertainment, and utilities. Once an envelope is empty, I stop spending.
Speaker C: The day my paycheck arrives, forty percent is automatically transferred into long-term index funds and high-yield savings accounts before I can touch it.
Speaker D: I meticulously compare promotional flyers and discount vouchers across rival supermarket chains every weekend to purchase groceries at the lowest possible cost.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e','set9'),(1830,2,'MCQ','a. Speaker A: ____',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e','set9'),(1831,2,'MCQ','b. Speaker B: ____',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e','set9'),(1832,2,'MCQ','c. Speaker C: ____',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e','set9'),(1833,2,'MCQ','d. Speaker D: ____',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','21be4a6d-bcb7-48ff-96bc-018e492c9e2e','set9'),(1834,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to two people talking about electric vehicles (EVs) versus conventional petrol vehicles. Who expresses these opinions?','Man: The initial showroom sticker price on new electric vehicles is still undeniably prohibitive for the average working family. However, the sheer performance advantage—the instantaneous torque, seamless acceleration, and total absence of engine vibration—makes EVs distinctly superior to internal combustion cars.
Woman: That performance is exhilarating, and plugging the car in at home overnight provides unparalleled daily convenience—no more smelly petrol stations! But we cannot ignore the highway infrastructure deficit: outside major cities, public fast-charging networks still require substantial expansion if road trips are to be stress-free.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241','set9'),(1835,2,'MCQ','Initial showroom purchase prices remain excessively high for average motorists',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241','set9'),(1836,2,'MCQ','Home overnight charging provides unparalleled daily convenience',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241','set9'),(1837,2,'MCQ','Public highway fast-charging networks still require substantial expansion',NULL,NULL,1,3,NULL,'click','null','3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241','set9'),(1838,2,'MCQ','Instant acceleration and silent cabin performance make EVs distinctly superior',NULL,NULL,1,4,NULL,'click','null','3da582dd-29d6-408c-bf37-68976d42d241','set9'),(1839,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to a technology columnist on the radio reviewing a modern smart-home security ecosystem.','Columnist: Setting up the Sentinel Smart Home security hub was a breath of fresh air. The dashboard layout on the mobile application was remarkably clear and responsive, enabling users to customize sensor triggers and stream high-definition video feeds without lag. Looking at the wider smart home market, however, consumer frustration is mounting over walled gardens. Interoperability between competing brand ecosystems remains frustratingly fractured; getting devices from different manufacturers to communicate reliably without custom bridging hubs is still far too complicated for mainstream buyers.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','baceff11-a2d5-49b0-a9af-9a0c615d953b','set9'),(1840,2,'MCQ','What is the columnist\'s opinion of the mobile application interface?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','baceff11-a2d5-49b0-a9af-9a0c615d953b','set9'),(1841,2,'MCQ','What is the columnist\'s overall view of consumer smart-home automation?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','baceff11-a2d5-49b0-a9af-9a0c615d953b','set9'),(1842,2,'AUDIO_MCQ','Listen to an urban agro-ecologist on the radio discussing municipal rooftop farming and community gardens.','Agro-ecologist: When municipalities assess urban rooftop farms, they often focus on kilograms of produce harvested or stormwater runoff reduction. In my fieldwork, however, the most profound community benefit is fostering intergenerational social connections and neighborhood mental wellbeing—bringing retirees and schoolchildren together to nurture living plants transforms community cohesion. Conversely, when looking at high-tech commercial vertical farms, many venture-backed start-ups are discovering that high electricity and climate-control costs make growing staple crops economically unsustainable compared to traditional farming. Vertical technology works well for microgreens, but not for feeding cities.',NULL,0,0,NULL,'prompt','null','137976e9-b142-4345-8783-4e563bd84334','set9'),(1843,2,'MCQ','What does the ecologist identify as the most profound community benefit of urban gardens?',NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,'click','null','137976e9-b142-4345-8783-4e563bd84334','set9'),(1844,2,'MCQ','What is the ecologist\'s view on the commercial viability of high-tech vertical farms?',NULL,NULL,1,2,NULL,'click','null','137976e9-b142-4345-8783-4e563bd84334','set9'),(1845,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a cooking club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1846,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What is your favourite cuisine to cook?',NULL,NULL,2,1,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1847,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','What dish did you prepare yesterday?',NULL,NULL,3,2,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1848,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Which cooking utensil do you use most?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1849,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','How often do you cook at home?',NULL,NULL,5,4,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1850,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Where do you buy your fresh groceries?',NULL,NULL,5,5,NULL,'click','null','12cc9020-c124-4b16-ba64-15ad8044836c','set9'),(1851,3,'QUESTION_FORM','the cooking club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','286cb97b-0086-4fa5-84ca-02fecee2c36e','set9'),(1852,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Please write some reasons why you are interested in joining a cooking club.',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','286cb97b-0086-4fa5-84ca-02fecee2c36e','set9'),(1853,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a cooking club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','9b66254b-99a1-418a-a2aa-f03412335c0a','set9'),(1854,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Chef Marco: Welcome to the club! Can you remember the very first meal you ever cooked completely by yourself? How did it turn out?',NULL,NULL,5,1,NULL,'click','null','9b66254b-99a1-418a-a2aa-f03412335c0a','set9'),(1855,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Chloe: Great to have you with us! What are your favourite local farmers\' markets or specialty food stores in the area?',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','9b66254b-99a1-418a-a2aa-f03412335c0a','set9'),(1856,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Nathan: What is the most complicated or technically demanding recipe you have ever tried to master?',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','9b66254b-99a1-418a-a2aa-f03412335c0a','set9'),(1857,3,'QUESTION_FORM','a cooking club',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','d61cf5cd-601c-477c-a5c1-607712dfe68a','set9'),(1858,3,'QUESTION_FORM','Dear member,
We regret to inform you that our scheduled guest instructor, the renowned French pastry chef Mr. Antoine Laurent, will unfortunately not be able to host this Sunday\'s artisanal pastry masterclass due to an urgent family medical emergency in Paris. While Chef Laurent cannot lead the hands-on workshop, club members have the exclusive privilege of purchasing his deluxe, autographed patisserie recipe compendium and pastry tool kit for the special member price of 22 dollars. If you wish to reserve a kit, please notify the club manager.',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,'click','null','d61cf5cd-601c-477c-a5c1-607712dfe68a','set9'),(1859,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 1: Write an email to your friend. Write about your feelings and what you would like to do. Write about 50 words. You have 10 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,2,NULL,'click','null','d61cf5cd-601c-477c-a5c1-607712dfe68a','set9'),(1860,3,'WRITING_PROMPT','Task 2: Write an email to the manager. Explain your feelings about the notice and say what you would like the club to do. Write 120-150 words. You have 20 minutes.',NULL,NULL,5,3,NULL,'click','null','d61cf5cd-601c-477c-a5c1-607712dfe68a','set9'),(1861,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the email given below. Choose one word from the drop-down list for each gap. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1862,4,'MCQ','We need [blank] printed agendas for the delegates.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1863,4,'MCQ','Don’t [blank] to test the wireless microphones before the clients arrive.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1864,4,'MCQ','The catering van [blank] early on Monday mornings.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1865,4,'MCQ','I have an executive briefing scheduled in the lower [blank].',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1866,4,'MCQ','I will meet you at the reception counter at [blank] 8 o’clock.',NULL,NULL,3,0,NULL,'select','null','c6cb1afe-08d0-4dee-845b-08347a76ae17','set9'),(1867,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from a report. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','9e42ed86-2ac5-4873-9321-0a74a5fba2a6','set9'),(1868,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','an employee expense reimbursement policy

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "If you intend to claim reimbursement for overseas business travel expenses, please observe this procedure.", "order": 1}, {"text": "Before you can receive any company reimbursement, you must submit a certified itemized claim sheet.", "order": 2}, {"text": "You can complete this expenditure claim via the online employee portal within thirty days of travel.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Our automated finance system will disburse approved funds once managerial approval is submitted.", "order": 4}, {"text": "Upon verifying submitted expense receipts, the audit officer will issue your payment confirmation code.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Please retain all itemized paper receipts securely in your audit envelope for twelve months.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "If you intend to claim reimbursement for overseas business travel expenses, please observe this procedure.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','9e42ed86-2ac5-4873-9321-0a74a5fba2a6','set9'),(1869,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The sentences below are from an introductory text. Put the sentences in the correct order. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','1061aba9-3196-4e69-b7dd-2a09f22b0fa2','set9'),(1870,4,'DRAG_DROP_ORDERING','the restoration of classical oil paintings

',NULL,NULL,4,0,NULL,'click','{"items": [{"text": "In classical art restoration, there is a painstaking protocol for stabilizing aged oil paintings.", "order": 1}, {"text": "The restorer begins by conducting multi-spectral infrared scans to map underlying canvas cracks.", "order": 2}, {"text": "Their selection of micro-cleansing agents is crucial because harsh chemical solvents dissolve original brushwork.", "order": 3}, {"text": "Apprentice conservators must understand how varying varnish solvents and pigment binders react.", "order": 4}, {"text": "This delicate technique allows specialists to remove oxidized surface grime without harming historical glaze layers.", "order": 5}, {"text": "Students can practice these inpainting skills under supervision in museum conservation laboratories in Vienna.", "order": 6}], "drag_items": ["Item 1"], "drop_zones": ["Zone 1"], "fixed_sentence": "In classical art restoration, there is a painstaking protocol for stabilizing aged oil paintings.", "correct_mapping": {"0": 0}}','1061aba9-3196-4e69-b7dd-2a09f22b0fa2','set9'),(1871,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Four local residents were interviewed by a neighborhood magazine about their local facility. Read the four texts below. Match each person with one statement.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1872,4,'QUESTION_FORM','the city\'s newly opened bus rapid transit (BRT) line',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1873,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person A

The glaring flaw along this new transit corridor is the complete lack of route schedule signs. The few electronic arrival displays are regularly blacked out, and passengers stand bewildered wondering when buses will arrive. This confusion peaks during early morning commuter hours. I still ride this route because private cab fares are absurdly high. Many station ticketing machines are completely out of order, so the council should remove them and install smart contactless tap-and-go pillars instead.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1874,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person B

Most of the metal benches inside the bus shelters are rusty, broken, and uncomfortable. The transport authority should replace them with weather-proof benches and secure the wobbling handrails along the passenger platforms. The dedicated bus lanes are great, but the lane restriction signs get knocked down constantly. You need a transit marshal stationed at key junctions to keep cars out. Having three customer service agents standing together chatting at the terminus is an absolute waste of public transit staffing budget.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1875,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person C

I find it really tricky to navigate the transfer stations on this new line. Station zone numbering is completely illogical, and platform markers are frequently hidden by advertising billboards. Furthermore, the central waiting platform was built right next to the diesel exhaust ventilation towers, which are supposed to run quietly. It is deafeningly noisy whenever the exhaust extraction blowers turn on. The boarding walkways are much too narrow, leaving no space to pause with a stroller without causing a bottleneck.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1876,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Person Person D

I have always been a vocal proponent of this rapid transit corridor. Ever since my college years, public transit has been my main way to collect urban transit data and travel across town. I still ride it twice a week to survey passenger boarding patterns and test smart-card apps. The express travel speeds are outstanding, but there is an acute shortage of technical maintenance staff. I notice this every time platform smart gates fail or ticketing barcode scanners freeze. There is never a repair technician around to fix mechanical faults, which happen all the time.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1877,4,'MCQ','(\'16\', \'Who believes the transit system requires a larger on-call technical repair team?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1878,4,'MCQ','(\'17\', \'Who suggests removing defective ticket machines to install modern contactless pillars?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1879,4,'MCQ','(\'18\', \'Who thinks the platform transfer codes and directional markers are poorly organized?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1880,4,'MCQ','(\'19\', \'Who thinks the station seating and platform guardrails require replacement and repair?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1881,4,'MCQ','(\'20\', \'Who notes that waiting platforms are affected by excessive noise from ventilation equipment?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1882,4,'MCQ','(\'21\', \'Who encounters recurring technical faults with platform gate hardware and scanners?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1883,4,'MCQ','(\'22\', \'Who utilizes the rapid transit line specifically to gather transportation research data?\')',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','40bfae61-0f53-45a5-be19-d6e2db52da2b','set9'),(1884,4,'QUESTION_FORM','Read the passage quickly. Choose a heading from the list for each numbered paragraph. There is one heading that you do not need. The first one is done for you.',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1885,4,'QUESTION_FORM','The Discovery of the Terracotta Army',NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,'click','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1886,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 1:

Archaeological authorities initially believed that the well site contained only a modest cache of ancient ceramics. Senior state historians argued that historical annals made no clear reference to an immense underground clay legion. However, field specialists noticed that fragments found at the site exhibited unprecedented craftsmanship, suggesting an elite imperial commission. Skeptics cautioned that launching a massive excavation over valuable farmland was premature. Field archaeologists maintained that exploratory trenching would reveal an unprecedented historical vault.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1887,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 2:

The site required unprecedented structural protections before systematic excavation could commence. Giant steel hangar structures were engineered over open subterranean trenches to shield exposed clay figures from sun and rainfall. Heavy climate-control units were installed to manage humidity levels. The logistical operation was enormous, requiring fleets of specialized trucks to deliver conservation chemicals, structural steel trusses, lighting arrays, and specialized sandbags. The surrounding field station was supplied with extensive laboratory equipment and living quarters for hundreds of researchers.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1888,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 3:

A multidisciplinary excavation corps—comprising paleopathologists, metallurgists, skilled restorers, and master draftsmen—was assembled under national directive. Armed with dental picks, fine camel-hair brushes, precision calipers, and specialized adhesive solutions, they methodically pieced together thousands of shattered clay warriors and horses, documenting every fragment with photographic care.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1889,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 4:

Excavation teams painstakingly cleared four massive underground chambers spanning several square miles. Working through meters of compacted loess soil, they uncovered over eight thousand life-sized soldiers, along with hundred-strong cavalry units, bronze battle chariots, and genuine lethal weaponry. Remarkably, each warrior possessed completely individualized facial features, hairstyles, and armor details. Chemical analysis of weapons revealed that bronze swords retained their razor-sharp edges thanks to ancient chromium salt plating, defying centuries of burial.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1890,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 5:

The unveiling of the Terracotta Army triggered intense academic debate throughout global historical circles. International antiquarians argued over whether Greek artisans might have influenced the naturalistic sculpting techniques of the Qin dynasty. Others questioned the exact labor models used to produce such unprecedented quantities of ceramic figures. Nonetheless, metallurgists verified that the weaponry reflected a highly standardized, mass-production assembly system, rewriting modern perceptions of ancient Qin industrial organization.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1891,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 6:

In the decades following the initial discovery, successive teams of archaeologists have utilized non-destructive radar and satellite imagery to survey the broader imperial necropolis. Modern researchers have located untouched subterranean palaces and water channels using thermal sensors, while international television networks have produced award-winning documentaries profiling the unexcavated central tomb mound.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1892,4,'MCQ','Paragraph 7:

The wonder of the Terracotta Army continues to captivate the global public. Exhibits of the clay soldiers have toured major world capitals, drawing millions of enthralled visitors. Today, the excavation site is protected as a UNESCO World Heritage Site, remaining one of China’s most revered cultural treasures and an enduring symbol of ancient civilization.',NULL,NULL,2,0,NULL,'select','null','bce727ed-97fd-4a6b-9f9f-5e122a0df44c','set9'),(1893,5,'MCQ','She ordered ____________ extra portion of steamed dumplings.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1894,5,'MCQ','There isn\'t _____________ fresh milk left in the refrigerator.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1895,5,'MCQ','Traveling by plane is considerably faster _________ traveling by ferry.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1896,5,'MCQ','I ________ admire her steadfast dedication to charitable causes.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1897,5,'MCQ','The hospital board __________ to construct a new pediatric wing next year.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1898,5,'MCQ','If the delivery truck __________ late, we will postpone the installation.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1899,5,'MCQ','The team was completely __________ by the overwhelming positive feedback.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1900,5,'MCQ','He doesn\'t ___________ take the highway during rush hour.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1901,5,'MCQ','Have you ever ___________ fresh pasta from scratch?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1902,5,'MCQ','All passengers ___________ fasten their seatbelts during turbulence.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1903,5,'MCQ','The research team managed ___________ the experimental trials on time.',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(1904,5,'MCQ','_______________ drafted the final version of the peace treaty?',NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,'click','null',NULL,'set9'),(19